<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Luyana Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Tikezo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Etikezo no Atumiwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tikezo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tik</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIKEZO</para>
  <para style="mt2">no Atumiwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa ku Tikezo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no Tikezo ni buka no ngambolo no matatekelo no Keleke noomo inakuhasanyezwa okutunda mu Jelusalema okuta mu Judeya, mu Samaliya, mane ni mumaneku anjili ngeso, kanyi feela omo Jesu ana kwambelela aaiyetwa aye abo yo kasi kambamena kale ku wilu (1.8). Kama inakuñoliwa kwa Luka woyo kame yona kuñola Eliywi okwamana kwa Luka. Neli osikukwiyeta onene kona kuli kama anaku mamelanga onene mukuteula oulshanago wino. Nakulita etibuka tonje, ebuka yaye mane ni buka no Tikezo kwa Siofilasi woyo neli mu Gelike, kono eti buka tonyene kama tina kuñolelwa kumindi yao asikulapela bomweya ku ma Gelike mane ni ku ma Juda (1.1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no Tikezo kuti kama ina kun̄oliwa mukaci ka myaka 60-64 munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite kakuli ebuka kama ibwa abo Paulusi yoka situndisiwa kale mutolongo. Luka kame nakwendabo ni mutumiwa Paulusi mi mane kame ana kuñola eyi ebuka yooli mu Antiyoki. Cwale abo Etikezo ni kutwalelela ku buka ya Luka mi kama itateka ni Jesu yo Kamba mena kuwilu. Elibaka no kuñola eyi ebuka kama lukufekile kanyi eliba ana kuñolela ebuka ya Luka. Kama ana kusaelanga Siofilasi nji mane nipalo no asikulapela ikule ngeso kanyi omo ana kwiyeteta mi nakuñola okwamana ni kuyoya kwa Jesu mane ni kuhasana kwaa sikulapela.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no Tikezo kama ituba omwanda no Tikeleke no matatekelo noomo tina kumonahalelanga okuyoya mu tumelo mwa Jesu. Omwanda no atumiwa kama utumonisa omo tufanena okusepela amaata no Mebo no kukena muku hasanya eliñusa kwaa kwetu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no yambo</para>
  <para style="io2">Baweli e Mebo no kukena kama iiya kwaaiyetwa mane ni Tikeleke sebeli titateka okukula (1.1-8; 1).</para>
  <para style="io2">Aka no wili etikeleke kama tiyandisiwa mi sebeli titateka okukutaba mwiibaka ili kundee ya Jelusalema (8.2-12; 23).</para>
  <para style="io2">Munyima yeyo Paulusi sebeli ota mumusipili waye no matatekelo noulapeli (12.24-14; 28).</para>
  <para style="io2">Cwale abo ekuta sebeli ikuwana ba Jelusalema okulelisana eso sifanena kwa sikulumela aano ubya (15.1-35).</para>
  <para style="io2">Esisis tatamakao Paulusi sebeli ota mumusipili waye nowili noulumeli (15.36-18; 22).</para>
  <para style="io2">Munyima yeyo sebeli okutela mumusipili waye nowatu noulumeli (18.23-20; 38)</para>
  <para style="io2">Cwale abo Paulusi yo wanungiwa kale mu Jelusalema (21-26)</para>
  <para style="io2">Bama maneneno sebeli otundisiwa mu Jelusalema okutwaliwa ku Loma (27-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Mutompehi Teofilasi, mu buka no matatekelo, kame nina kun̄ola etingambolo no inu yonje ana ku tenda Jesu ni kwiyeta <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>okutwala ba liywaa ana ku shimbelwa ku wilu, aba ana kumana okuba etaelo mu maata no Mebo No Kukena kwaa tumiwa awo ana kuketa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Munyima no mayando aye sebeli okumonahaza kwa onyene yo yoya mu ukumonahaza aka no kupula mu maywaa anakukwana makumi anee (40) mi yo lemine okwamba eyi no mubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Yo ikalile noo, sebeli waaba etaelo nji mulese okutunda mu Jelusalema, kono mu tatelele esepiso ya Sitange eyo ana kwamba, eyi muna yupu kwa mene. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Kakuli Jowani naku kolobeza ni meyi, kono kakwisa amaywaa no kupula okutunda abano anyi mba mukolobeziwa ni Mebo No Kukena.<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu yo shimbelwa ku wilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maleka16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka24.50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Cwale atumiwa aba ana kukuwana ni Jesu, sebeli amwibanguta nji, “Mbumu, ninji ba nako ino kame so usete omubuso kwa Isilaele?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Jesu sebeli waatambula nji, “Ka musibiwa okulimuka enako simba emiaka eyo ana beeke sitange mu maata aye. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Kono mba mutambula amaata aba saiiye Emebo No Kukena baanyi, mi kame samutende etipaki tange mu Jelusalema, ni mu Judeya ni mu Samaliya moonje, ni kutwala ku mamaneneno no litunga.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Aba ana kumana okwamba ngeso, sebeli oshimbelwa ku wilu amwalikete, mi elikumbi sebeli limutundisa mu miyo oo. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Yo katile ku wilu, mi onyene aaliketile ku wilu, ababo alume ayiili akufukile etinyambi no likena, sebeli aiya mukwimana ku nyonga yoo. <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>Sebeli aamba nji, “Aanyi alume no Galileya, ngasibine aba mwimanine me mwaliketile ku wilu? Uyu Jesu, ona shimbiwa okuta ku wilu, mbaiyi mundila imweya kanyi omo mumumonena yo katile mu wilu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matiyasi aba na Ketiwa nji ayole Judasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Mateu27.3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Cwale atumiwa aba ana kuukela ku Jelusalema okutunda ba lilundu no itondo ya Olibe, eli lili beebi ni Jelusalema mi omusipili wateni kame okukumanena ni liywaa no Sabata ba ku weenda. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Cwale aba ana kwingena mu mulenen̄i, sebeli ata ku musiyo oli kuwilu omo ana kwikalanga Pitolosi, ni Jowani, ni Jakobo, ni Andiliyasi, ni Filipi, ni Tomasi, ni Batolome, ni Mateu, ni Jakobo omwana Alufeya, ni Simoni Zeloti, ni Judasi omwana Jakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Onje aa muumweya sebeli aongoteteta oku lapela, bamweya naakati, okubekabo ni Maliya inawaye Jesu, na inaaye.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Mu maywaa awo Pitolosi sebeli oimana mukaci no aasikupumena bamweya naaanu no kupula aa akwana omwaanda naanu makumi ayili (120), ni kwamba nji, <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>“Aalikani ange, elin̄olo kame lifanena okwiyatetetwa, elyo ku Mebo No Kukena eli lina kwambiwa kwa Dabida, eli lyaama oku kumanena eya Judasi woyo ona kutwaletela aa ana kununga Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Kakuli neli omunjili mwaaci mi kame ana kubiwa ekalulo mu musebezi wetu.” (<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Cwale wuyu mulume sebeli oula elitema ni mupuzo no mali no uyii waye, mi sebeli okwela banji ni kukauka bakaci mi einu na mu lipumo lyaye sebeli itundela bandee.<verse eid="ACT 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Cwale etaba eyi sebeli ilimukiwa kwaanu onje ana kwikala mu Jelusalema, mi elyo litema sebeli liisaniwa nji Hakeludama mu mushobo woo, okutalusa nji, “Elitema no unyinga.”)<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>“Kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe mu buka no Lisamu nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Cwale esibaka saye sifutuke amatota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">cwale mi kuulwe omunu so yoya mo.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kame kun̄olilwe kame nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Mi esibaka saye no musebezi sishimbiwe ku munjili.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>“Abakulingeso, omunjili kwa lume onakwendanga naaci mu nako yonje Mbumu Jesu yoenda naaci, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>okutangisa ba kolobezo ya Jowani okulita ba liywaa ana ku shimbiwa kwaaci, omunjili kwa lume aa kame afanena okutenda opaki naaci ku kwinguka kwaye.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Cwale sebeli alita aanu ayili, Josefa osi litina lya Basabasi, (nakwisaniwa kame nji, Jusitasi) ni Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Cwale sebeli a lapela ni kwamba nji, “Mbumu, weene olimukile emicima no aanu onje, otumonise kwaa ayili anyine ona kete <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>nji ashimbe esibaka mu situlo ni muutumiwa owo ana tundu Judasi, ni kuta ku sibaka saye.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Cwale sebeli ashebuluka oonje, mi sebeli kulemiwa Matiyasi, woyo ona kwekiziwa kwao atumiwa likumi ni mumweya. (11)<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Okwiiya no Mebo No Kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Cwale eliywaa no Pentakota aba lina ku keela, onje kame ana kuungana mu sibaka simweya. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Ababo sebeli kuyupahala omulumo ona kutundelela ku wilu kanyi Emebo no lin̄ungwa, mi sebeli iiyala endoo yonje omo ana ikalanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Cwale sebeli ku monahala kwa onyene eso sikufekile kanyi etindimi no mulilo, awo aku tabile mi ni kwiiya mu kwikala beulu yoo ba munjili ni munjili. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Onje kame ana kwiyala ku Mebo No Kukena mi sebeli atangisa okwamba mu tipuwo tindina, omo Emebo No Kukena ina kwaa bela okwamba. <verse eid="ACT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikalanga aendisi no Majuda mu Jelusalema, awo ana kucilanga Nyambe aa atundelela mu tinaha tonje na mu litunga. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Cwale omulumo owo aba una kuyupahala aanu no kupula sebeli aunganako, mi kame ana kukomoka, kakuli onje kame ana kwayupa aamba mu tipuwo too. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Mi onje kame ana kukomoka onene, ni kwamba nji, “Kasa nji aa onje aamba ni Magalileya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Cwale iikene aba twaa yupa aamba mutipuwo tetu toonje? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Aaci Amapanta ni Mamede ni Maelami naa ayakile mu Mesopotoniya, ni mu Judeya ni mu Kapadosiya, mu Ponto ni mu Esiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>aa na ku Filikiya ni Panfiliya, Egepita naa ali mu ibaka no Lebiya ikubapile ni Silene naa atunda mu mindi no Loma, oonje Majuda ni mapulosebelite, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Amakilete ni Maalabe, kame twa yupa aamba mu malimi etu omusebezi no kuwaba wa Nyambe!”<verse eid="ACT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Mi oonje kame ana kukomoka ni ku hakanyeha, akwambisa oonje nji, “Eyi taba kame italusa iikene?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Kono anjili sebeli aasheka okwamba nji, “Kame akolilwe ni waine no ubya!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elin̄usa lya Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli oimana naa akwana likumi ni mumweya ni kwamba ni liywii no kuyupahala onene nji, “Anyi aanu na mu Judeya naanyi monje muyoya mu Jelusalema, mulimuke etaba eyi, mi muteetete wino ku maywi ange.<verse eid="ACT 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Aa aanu kasikoliwa, omo mu hupulela, kakuli ino isili ehola no (9 okoloko), <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>kono esi esi nakwambiwa kwa munuhi wa Nyambe Jowele nji,<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>‘Cwale enako no mamaneneno aba saiye, kame kwamba Nyambe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">kame sani itele Emebo yange ba munu yonje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mi aanenu no ashimani naa no akatana kame sa nuhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mi andumbana enu mba mono etipono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">mi naa supali enu mbaa loto etitolo.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Ee, mi mane naabika ange no alume naa no akati mu maywaa awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mba na itele Emebo yange mi kame sa nuhe.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Kame sani tende etimakazo mu wilu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">neyi saimonahale ba litunga bano banji.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ounyinga, ni mulilo, ni wise<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>eliywaa kame saali futuke okutenda ouwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">okweti afutuke kanyi ounyinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">abo eliywaa lya Mbumu ekalya siiya kale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">eliywaa linene eli lilimukiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Mi cwale ao onje aisana ba litina lya Mbumu kame sayoyisiwe.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>“Anyi alume no Esilaele, muyupe amaywi aa! Jesu no Nazaleta omulume muna limukisiwa kwa Nyambe ni emisebezi no kongola, ni timakazo, ni tiponiso eyo ana kutenda Nyambe mwa yonyene mukaci kenu, kanyi omo mulimukele naanyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Wuyu Jesu ona kubetekiwa mu muhupulo ni mukulimuka kwa Nyambe, na muku mungongotela ni ku mwibaa ni maoko aawo asiku tenda ouyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Kono Nyambe na ku mwingula kwaafu, okumu lukulula kweeyi no kucilisa no aafu, kakuli ka kwa siku twesahala nji anungiwe ku lufu. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Kakuli Dabida abaamba okukumanena ni yonyene nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Kame ni monanga Ombumu balubala wange enako yonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">kakuli kame ali ku Lyoko lyange no silyo mi kanitamba okunyanganyisiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>cwale abo omucima wange kame onaku wabelelwa, mi olulimi lwange kame lunaku nyakalala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">mane ni lutu lwange mba luyoyo mu sepo,<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>kakuli kautamba kuleselela Emebo yange mu sibaka no afu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">simba nji oleselele woyo no kukena nji aole.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Kame ona nimonisa endila ita ku moyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">mi okumonahala kowe kame sakuni iyate oku nyakalala.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>“Abaange, kame ni myambela epatalaza eyi no njekulyetu Dabida nji kame ana kufa ni kupumbekiwa, mi elibita lyaye kwa lisili kwaaci ni balelo lino. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Mu kutenda omunuhi wa Nyambe, ni mu kulimuka nji Nyambe kame ana musepisa mukweeta kwaye nji kame sakutunde omunjili ku lusika lwaye ni kwikala ba lubona lwaye. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>kame ana kumona eyi nakuuso ni kwamba eyi no kwinguka kwa Kilesite nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Katamba okuleselelwa musibaka no ao no kufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">simba nji olutu lwaye luole.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Yokame Jesu ona ingulwa kwa Nyambe kwaafu, mi mutaba eyo aaci toonje kame tuli etipaki. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Munyima no kukambamisetwa ku Lyoko no silyo lya Nyambe, mi sebeli otambula Emebo No Kukena ana ku sepisiwa kwa Sitaye, cwale na iitelwe kwaaci yo mumona ni ku yupa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Kakuli Dabida kasiku kambamena ku wilu, kono yo kame onamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘OMBUMU naamba kwa Mbumu wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Oikale ku Lyoko lyange no silyo<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>konji aba sani tende eila yowe esipula no malyatelo no makondo owe.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>“Cwale mulesele onje asi ndoo no Isilaele alimuke eniti nji Nyambe na mutende oumbumu ni Kilesite wuyu Jesu woyo munaku ngongotela!”<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Mi cwale aba ana kuyupa eyi, kaa sikukuyupa wino ku micima mi sebeli aamba kwa Pitolosi ni kwa atumiwa onje nji, “Abeetu, ngasibine sa tu tende?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Mubake mi mu kolobeziwe moonje mu litina lya Jesu Kilesite nji mu lemenwe ku ibi yenu, mi mba mu tambula empo no Mebo No Kukena. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Kakuli esepiso kame ili kwaanyi ni kwaa nenu ni kwao ali oku no kuleba, awo onje sa isaniwe kwa Mbumu Nyambe wetu.<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Pitolosi kame ana kwa kutaza ni maywii amanjili no kupula ana kwa kumbela, yo amba nji, “Mu ku babalele ku lusika olo no kwiiba!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Cwale awo ana ku tambula amaywii aye sebeli akolobeziwa, mi kame sebeli kwekeziwa aanu no kukwana eikiti yaatu (3;000) ba liywaa elyo.<verse eid="ACT 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oupilo Mukaci no Alumeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Mi cwale sebeli aongoteteta onyene mu tuto no atumiwa, ni muukuwana, muukutabela esinkwa ni mu titapelo.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Mi okucila sebeli kwikala mwaanu onje, mi etimakazo no kupula ni tiponiso na ikutendahala mwa atumiwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Mi asikupumena sebeli aikala bamweya nukutabela einu yoo yonnje. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Mi kame ana kuulisa amatema oo ni ufumu woo ni ku tabela aanu onje, omo ana kusaelela omunu yonje. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Mi mu liywaa ni liywaa kame ana kwikalanga bamweya mu ndoo ya Nyambe, nuukutabela esinkwa mu tindoo too, kame ana kulya eilya yoo mu tabo ni micima no kuwabelelwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Aalemine okulumbeka Nyambe ni ku wabelelwa kwaanu onje. Mi mu liywaa ni liywaa Nyambe kame na kuekeza ku palo no awo anakuyoyisiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Omulume no siyanga yo Balisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Cwale Pitolosi ni Jowani kame ana ku kambemena ku ndoo ya Nyambe ba nako no milapelo, enako no munji eitenda eyi no waatu (15:00 okoloko). <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Mi kame kuna kwikala omulume no siyanga okutunda ba kuleiwa kwaye kame ana kushimbiwangwa, woyo ona kubekiwangwa ba mwelo no limota lya Jeluslema mu liywaa, owo ona kwisaniwa nji wa kuwaba nji akumbele etuso kwaanu awo ana kwingenanga mu ndoo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Cwale aba na kumona Pitolosi ni Jowani aingena, sebeli waakumbela amali. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Mi Pitolosi sebeli omwaliketa, bamweya ni Jowani ni kwamba nji, “Otwa likete!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Cwale yonyene sebeli waaliketa ni ku tatelela okutambula esinjili okutundelela kwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli omwambela nji, “Mene sikwite esilibela ni gauda, kono kame ni kuba esi nikwite, mu litina lya Jesu Kilesite no Nazaleta, oimane wende!”<verse eid="ACT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Pitolosi sebeli omushimba ni Lyoko no silyo ni ku mwimeka, mi ababo amakondo ni tingongo taye sebeli yongola. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Mi sebeli omatoka ni kwimana ni kweenda ni kwingena mu lilapa no ndoo ya Nyambe nonyene, yo enda ni ku matoka ni ku lumbeka Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Mi aanu onje sebeli amumona yo enda ni ku lumbeka Nyambe, <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>sebeli amulimuka nji yokame osikukumbela etituso ba mweelo no kuwaba no ndoo ya Nyambe, mi kame ana kukomoka onene ni kumakala kweyo ina tendahala kwa yonyene woyo mulume.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi yo Aamba Kwaanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Abo yo situndamene Pitolosi ni Jowani, aanu onje sebeli aitukela kwa onyene mu sibaka no mukunda wa Solomoni, akomokile onene. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Mi cwale Pitolosi aba na mono ngeso sebeli waambela aanu nji, “Alume no Isilaele, iikene aba mu komoka etaba eyi, simba iikene aba mu twaliketile ngeso, kanyi ni mu maata etu simba ni mu kukuna kwetu kwa Nyambe aba tuna twese wuyu mulume nji aende? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Nyambe wa Abulahama ni wa Isaka ni wa Jakobo, Onyambe wa anjekulyetu, kame ana kanyisa omubika waye Jesu, woyo muna kuba ni ku mu kana balubala wa Pilato, naba ana kusinga nji amu lukulule. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Kono kame mu na kukana uyu no kukena ni kuluka, mi kame muna kukumbela omwibai nji alukululwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Namukwibaa omunya moyo, woyo ana kwingula Nyambe kwaafu, mi aaci kame tuli etipaki no taba eyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Mi elitina lyaye, mulibaka no tumelo mu litina lyaye, na li ongota wuyu mulume woyo mu mona ni ku limuka mi ni tumelo mwa Jesu na ibalisa wino wuyu mulume balubala wenu moonje.” <verse eid="ACT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>“Cwale bano, abange, Kame ni limukile nji kame mutenda mukwalimuka, kanyi omo anaku tendala aendisi enu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Kono eyo ana kwamba Nyambe ni tunwa no anuhi aye onje, nji Kilesite waye mba yanda, naiyatetetwe cwale. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Mubake cwale, mi musiuluke kame, nji eibi yenu ilemeniwe, enako eyo sakwiiye okuwetuluka sakutunde kwa Mbumu, <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>mi cwale kame sa tume Kilesite ona ketelwe aanyi, yonyene Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Woyo eliwilu kame lifanena okutambula okutwala enako eyo einu yonje abasa itendiwe eyino ubya eyo Nyambe ana kwamba ni tunwa no anuhi aye nokukena okutunda ku kale. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Mushe na kwamba nji, ‘Mbumu Nyambe mba tumu kwaanyi omunuhi okutunda kwaabenu kanyi omo anakuni tumena. Kame samu tetete kwa yonyene mu inu yonje eyo samiambele. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Mi kame sakutende nji omunu yonje woyo soulwa oku teteta kwa munuhi wa Nyambe mba sinyiwa okutunda kwaanu.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Cwale anuhi a Nyambe onje aa anamba elin̄usa, okutunda kwa Samuele naa aneyi munyima, kame ana nuhu etinako eto. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Kame muli aana no anuhi a Nyambe ni ulikani owo Nyambe ana kuba kwanjekulyenu. Ana kwamba kwa Abulahama nji, ‘cwale mu lusika lowe aanu onje na ba litunga mba fuyauliwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Nyambe nakutuma omubika waye kwaanyi oweli, okumi fuyola okufutula omunu yonje mwaanyi okutunda kuufokoli wenu.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi ni Jowani aali booso no Kuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Cwale alemine okwamba kwaanu, apulisita ni omukulu no atateleli no ndoo ya Nyambe na Saduki sebeli aiya kwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Atinine kakuli kame ana kwiyetanga aanu ni kupaka mwa Jesu eyi no kwinguka kwaafu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Cwale sebeli aanunga ni kwabeka mu tolongo okutwala ba liywaa linaku tatamako, kakuli neli amangolwaa. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Kono anokupula anakuyupa eliywi kame anaku pumena, mi epalo no aanu kame inaku kwana eikiti mutanu (5;000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Eliywaa linaku tatamako abusisi oo na kulu, na iyeti no mulawo wa Mushe sebeli aungana mu Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Aali ni Anna omukulu no apulisita ni Kayafa, ni Jowani, ni Alekizanda, nanjili no lubasi no apulisita akulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwaimeka mukaci koo, sebeli aaibanguta nji, “Ka maata simba ka litina lya nyine mukutusisa okutendisa einu eyii?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Cwale Pitolosi yo iyalile Emebo No Kukena, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Abusi no aanu na kulu, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>nji balelo kame twiibangutiwa okukumanena kweyi no kuwaba ina tendiwa ku mulume no sihole ni mumukwa ubine ana balisetwe, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>ilimukiwe kwaanyi moonje naanu onje no Isilaele, nji mu litina lya Jesu Kilesite no Nazaleta, woyo munaku ngongotela ba sifapano, woyo Nyambe ana ingula kwaafu, mwa yonyene uyu mulume kame aimanine wino balubala wenu.<verse eid="ACT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>‘Eli eliwee muna kukana anyi ayaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">kono kame lina futuka omutomo no muyako.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Cwale okuyoisisa kakusako ku munu yonje, kakuli kakwisa elitina linjili munji no liwilu eli libilwe kwaanu nji tuyoyiswe mwa lyonyene.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Cwale aba ana mona oundume wa Pitolosi ni Jowani sebeli alemuha nji kaasiku kwiyeta, mi neli aanu feela alume no utokwa sebeli akomoka ni lemuha nji kame na kwikalanga ni Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Kono ba kumona omulume onaku balisiwa oimanine kunyonga yoo, sebeli aulwa nesi ana kwamba. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Kono cwale aba ana kumana okwaa laela nji atunde ba kuta, sebeli atangisa okwaambisa mu kaci koo nji, <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>“Iikene sa tutende kwaa alume?” Kakuli emakazo eyi ilimukiwa ina tendiwa kwa onyene kame inayupahala kwaanu onje aa ayakile mu Jelusalema, mi katu twese okwilatula. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Kono nji etaba eyi yulwe oku yupahala kwaanu, twaakanise onene okwamba kame ku munu yonje mu litina lya Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Cwale sebeli aaisana ni kwaambela nji alese okwamba simba okwiyeta kame mu litina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Kono Pitolosi ni Jowani sebeli aatambula nji, “Mu kwatule mwenyene nji kame kulukile mu miyo a Nyambe okumikuteka , aanyi mwatule. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Kakuli aaci katutwese okulesela okwamba eyi tuna mono neyi tuna yupu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwacilisa sebeli aalukulula nji akutele. Kasikuwana oufosi nji aabe ekoto, mulibakano aanu onje kame anaku lumbeka Nyambe kweyo inaku tendahala. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Kakuli omulume woyo inaku tendahalela emakazo no ku balisiwa kame ana kwikala ni myaka ibitelela makumi anee.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo no Alumeli eyi no Undume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Cwale aba ana kumana oku lukululwa sebeli ata kwaa likani oo ni kwaambela eyo anaambele apulisita akulu na kulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Cwale aasikupumena aba ana kuyupa eyi, sebeli atumusa ku maywii oo onje oku lapela kwa Nyambe ni kwamba nji, Mbumu, wene ona uumbu eliwilu ni litunga ni liwate neyi ilimo! <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Kame ona kwamba ni kanwa no mushemi wetu Dabida, omubika wowe, okwamba ni meyo no kukena nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Iikene amacaba aba atwebile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">mi aanu ikene alelela eyi na mbulwa tuso?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>aambumu no litunga kame ana lumelelana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na endisi kame aku wanine bamweya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">okulwisa MBUMU ni ku lwisa Omuwabiwa waye.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Niti luli mu mumulenen̄i kame ana kukuwana bamweya okulwisa omubika no kukena woyo ona kuketa, onje Heloda ni Ponse Pilato na simacaba naanu no Isilaele. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Kame ana tende einu yonje eyi mu maata owe ni mulelo wowe eyo una kulela eyaka sitendahala kale, nji itendahale. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Cwale bano, Mbumu, omone emihupulo yoo, mi obe abika owe amaata no kwamba eliywi lyowe mu undume. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Cwale wolole elyoko lyowe oku balisa, mi etiponisa ni timakazo titendiwe mu litina lya Jesu omubika wowe no kukena.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Cwale aba ana ku mana oku lapela, esibaka omo ana kukuwanena bamweya sebeli sizikinyeha. Mi oonje sebeli aiyala ni Mebo No kukena ni kwamba amaywi a Nyambe ni undume.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alumeli aba ana kukutabela Einu yoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Cwale esikwata no aasikupumena sinakukuwana neli sa mucima ni mebo imweya. Kakwisa mukaci koo ona kwamba nji esinu ali naso nisaye yomboci, kono kame ana kuku tabelanga esinu akwite omukoo onje. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Cwale mu maata no kuneneba atumiwa ana kupaka onene okwinguka kwa Mbumu Jesu, mi esishemo sinene nasikwikala kwa onyene onje. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Kakwisa omunu ona kusinga esinjili mwa onyene. kakuli ano kupula awo anakwikala ni matema simba etindoo kame ana kuyulisanga, ni kulita amali nweso sina ulisiwa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>mi ni kusibeeka ku makondo no atumiwa, mi munu ni munu kame ana kutabelwanga omo asingela.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Cwale Josefa ona kwisaniwa kwa atumiwa nji Banabasi (okutalusa nji, “Omwana no susuwezo”), neli Mulibi, onaku leyelwa mu Saipulisi, <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>sebeli oulisa elitema lyaye, ni ku lita amali, ni kwabeeka ku makondo no atumiwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ananiasi ni Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Kono omulume wiisaniwa Ananiasi ni moywaye Safila sebeli aulisa esemba no litema lyoo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Kono mu tingana no moyo waye sebeli oteulako amanjili amali awo anaku ulisako ni kulitako fela amanjili amali ni kwabeeka ku makondo no atumiwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Cwale Pitoosi sebeli wamba nji, “Ananiasi, ikene Satani aba ona mulumelele mu mucima wowe nji woonge Emebo No Kukena okuteulela ku mali ona ulisa elitema? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Abo owasiku ulisa kale elitema neli lyowe, mi naaba onamana okuli ulisa, amali asitendile owe. Kasa neli omuhupulo wowe? Iikene cwale ona tendele ngesi mu mucima wowe? Kausonga aanu, kono kame onaungo Nyambe!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Cwale Ananiasi aba ana kuyupa amaywi aa, sebeli okwela banji ni kufa. Mi aanu onje ana kuyupa etaba eyi sebeli acila onene. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Andumbana sebeli aiya ni kufuka olutu lwaye ni kumutwala oka mu pumbeka.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Munyima no nako itenda etihola taatu moywaye sebeli okeela, yo kalimukile eyi ina tendahala. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Pitolosi sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Ona mbele nji kame muna ulisa elitema amali akuma aba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Mi sebeli otamula nji, “Ee, banakumu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Ngaibi muna lumelelana moonje okweteka Emebo no Mbumu? Omone, amakondo aawo anati muku pumbeka mbumowe aa okame ba mwelo, mi kame saku sakutwale ni wene!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Ababo sebeli okwela banji ku makondo aye ni kufa, mi sebeli amushimba nukamu pumbeka ku nyonga ya mbumwaye. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Cwale okucila kunene sebeli kwingena kwaanu no ndoo ya Nyambe ni kwaanu onje anakuyupa etaba eyi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etimakazo ni Tiponiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Cwale etimakazo ni tiponiso no kupula kame tinaku tendahala kwaanu ni maoko no atumiwa. Mi kame ana kukuwanenga mu sibaka sinjili sa Salomoni siisaniwa nji Kozwana. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Kakwisa omunu onakutwesa oukuwana noo, kono aanu kame ana kwaalumba onene mulikute. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Cwale anokupula ana kupumena kwa Mbumu kame anakwekezeha, alume naakati. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Mane kame kuna litiwa asikutoma mu tindila ni kwalangeka ba mimbeta ni bamiseme nji Pitolosi abasabite anjili kwa onyene afukiwe ku mwinda waye. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Naanu kame sebeli akuwana okutunda mumindi mu Jelusalema, sebeli alita asikutoma nawo akwite Emebo nokwiiba, onje sebeli abalisiwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atumiwa abaana kuyandisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Kono omupulisita omukulu bamweya nawo akuyupa naye onje na njili no Masaduki, sebeli ayupa omuna. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>sebeli anunga atumiwa ni kwaabeka mu tolongo no sicaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Kono ousiku elin̄eloi lya Mbumu sebeli liiya mukuyatulula emwelo no tolongo nikwatundisamo ni kwamba nji, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>“Mute mi mwimane mu ndoo ya Nyambe mi mwaambe kwaanu amaywi onje no moyo noubya.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Mi cwale aba ana kuyupa eyi, sebeli aingena lilapa no ndoo ya Nyambe amasiku ni kwiyeta. Cwale omupulisita omukulu sebeli oiya naawo anakwikalanga naye ni kwisana bamweya ekuta naanu onje no Isilaele, ni kutumena ku tolongo mukwaalita. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Kono otupaso aba tunakukeela, kasitu kwaawana mu tolongo, mi sebeli tuuka kukuta okabiha, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>“Natuwana etolongo iyatililwe wino natateleli aimanine ba mwelo, kono abatuna iyatulula katusiwanamo omunu mukaci!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Cwale onduna no ndoo ya Nyambe napuliisita akulu aba ana kuyupa amaywi aa, sebeli aziyeleha ni kukomoka onene kweyo inatendahala kwa atumiwa, abilaela nji eyi taba ngasibine saitendahale. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya omunu ni kwaambela nji, “Alume munakubeka mu tolongo kame aimanine mu ndoo ya Nyambe mi kame aiyeta aanu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Cwale onduna ni tupaso sebeli ata okaashimba, kono kasa mukubambaba, kakuli kame ana kucila aanu okwakonda ni mawee.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Cwale aba anakumana okwaalita, sebeli aabeka balubala no Kuta, mi omukulu no mupulisita sebeli waibanguta nji, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>“Natukumi laelela onene nji mulese okwiyeta mu litina lya Jesu, cwale bano namwiyata Jelusalema ni tuto yenu mi kame musinga okulita ounyinga no munu woyo beulu wetu!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Kono Pitolosi naatumiwa sebeli atambula nji, “Kame tufanena okukuteka Nyambe, kasa omunu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Onyambe no ashemi etu naingula Jesu kwaafu woyo muna kwibaa okumu ngongotela ba sitondo. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Nyambe nakumukulisa ni Lyoko lyaye no silyo nji atende omubusi ni muyoisi, woyo oba Isilaele okubaka ni kulemenwa eibi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Kame tuli aapaki kwiinu eyi, mi kame tukwite Emebo nokukena eyo anabi Nyambe kwaao amukuteka.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa eyi sebeli atina onene nikusinga okwaibaa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Kono omufalisi munjili onakwisaniwa nji Gamaliele, omwiyeti no mulawo woyo olumbiwa ku sicaba sonje, sebeli oimana ni kulaelela nji aatumiwa atundisetwe bandee ba nako icana, <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>cwale sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Alume no Isilaele, mutokomele eyi musinga kutenda kwaa alume. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Kakuli munyima no maywaa aaTeudasi sebeli omonahala, nuukutoya nji nisinu sinene, mi aanu no kukwana emyanda inee sebeli akuwana naye, kono nakwibaiwa nawo onje anakumu kon̄anga sebeli ahasana ni kubwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Munyima ya woyo, Judasi omu Galileya sebeli omonahala mu nako no sipalo mi sebeli okoka aanu no kupula, kono ni yonyene sebeli ofa, mi naawo anakumu kon̄anga sebeli ahasana. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Cwalehe mu taba eyi, kame ni myambela nji, mutundeko kwalume aa mi mwasiye omboci, nji ni mulelo simba omusebezi otunda kwaanu, mbaukwangwa, <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>kono nji kame itunda kwa Nyambe, kamutamba okwatwesa. mba mumonahala nji naanyi kame mulwisa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Cwale sebeli asitokomela ekelezo yaye, mi cwale abana mana okwisana atumiwa, sebeli aashapa ni kwaalaela nji alese okuukela okwiyeta aanu mu Litina lya Jesu, sebeli aalukulula nji akutele. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Cwale sebeli asiya esibaka no Kuta awabelelwe, kakuli kame atendilwe aa alukela okwenisiwa mulibaka no Litina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Mi amaywaa onje kasi kulesela okwiyeta mu Ndoo ya Nyambe ni mu tindoo nji Jesu yokame Kilesite.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Atusi anaku kwana mutanu nayili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Cwale mu nako eyo epalo no aiyetwa abainakwekezeha, aendisi no Majuda ao aamba esigelike sebeli atongokela aendisi no Majuda ao aamba esihebelu kakuli neli ambelwa ao kame anakuketululwa abaku biwa eilya no liywaa ni liywaa.<verse eid="ACT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Cwale atumiwa likumi nayili sebeli aisana aiyetwa onje ni kwaambela nji, “Kakulukele nji tulese okwiyeta eliywi lya Nyambe nji tube eiyi no kulya ba titafule. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Abetu, abakulingeso, mukete alume mutanu nayili mwaanyi aa asepahala aa aiyalile Emebo niku shangama, mi twabeke mu musebezi ou. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Kono aci mbatukongota muku lapela ni mu sebelezo no Liywi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Mi etaba eyo ana kwamba esikwata sonje sebeli siwabelelwa, mi sebeli aketa Setefani, omulume onaiyala etumelo ni Mebo No Kukena ni Filipi, ni Polokolasi, ni Nikolasi ni Timoni, ni Pamena, ni Nikolasi omupolosebelite na mu Antiyoke. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Esikwata esi sebeli asiimeka balubala no Atumiwa, sebeli alapela ni kwabeka amaoko oo beulu woo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Cwale eliywi lya Nyambe sebeli lyekezeha okwambiwa, ni palo no aiyetwa sebeli yekezeha onene mu Jelusalema, mane ni palo no kupula no apulisita sebeli akubeeka ku tumelo.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okunungiwa kwa Setefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Setefani ona kwiyala esishemo ni maata, sebeli otenda etimakazo ni tiponiso no kupula mu sicaba. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Cwale aanu anjili no ndoo no milapelo eyi isaniwa nji no alukuluhi, naa naku Sileni, naa naku Alekizandiya, naa naku tolopo no Silisia ni ku Asiya sebeli atangisa okukanana ni Setefani. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Kono sebeli akwangwa okukanana okushangama kwaye ni mebo eyo ana kwamba nayo. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Cwale sebeli ashonga alume anjili anakwamba nji, “Natumuyupu yo amba amaywi noku nyefula Mushe ni Nyambe!”<verse eid="ACT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Sebeli asusuweza ngeso esicaba nakulu, naiyeti no mulawo wa Mushe, mi sebeli amupatisa okumulema niku mulita balubala no Kuta. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Sebeli alita apaki no mapwa ana kwamba nji, “Uyu mulume kalesele okwamba eyambo no ku nyefula endoo ya Nyambe ni mulawo wa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Kakuli natumu yupu yo amba nji Jesu no Nazaleta wuyu mba sinyi esibaka eso, afutule ni mikwa no sizo eyi tunabiwi kwa Mushe!” <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Aanu onje aa anakwikala ba Kuta aba ana kumulubukela, sebeli amona olubala lwaye nji kame lukufekile kanyi olubala no lin̄eloi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Omwambelo wa Setefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Omupulisita omukulu sebeli wibanguta nji, “Etaba eyo kana moikalele?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Setefani sebeli otambula nji, “Abaange, naanyi asitange, muyupetete kwa mene! Nyambe no kanya nakumonahaza kwa sitetu Abulahama abo yosiikala mu Mesopotamiya yokasita kale okaikala mu Halani, <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>mi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Osiye esibaka sowe ni lusika lowe mi ote mu sibaka saniku monise.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Cwale sebelli otunda mu naha no Makaladeya ni kuta okaikala mu Halani. Munyima ya sitaye Abulahama okufa, Nyambe sebeli omutundisamo niku mulita mu naha ino muyoya nibalelo lino. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Ka simuba esanda omo, simba esibaka no kulyata elikondo, kono sebeli omusepisa nji yonyene ni masika aye mbaabiwa esibaka simba nji kakwite omwana.<verse eid="ACT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Cwale Nyambe sebeli omwambela nji, ‘Aikulyowe mba kayoyo mu naha no akoo omo sakaikale mu ukoba niku yandisiwa mu myaka nokukwana emyanda inee. (400) <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Kono kame sani atule aanu saabeeke mu ubika Nyambe sebeli wamba, mi munyima nweyo kame satundemo ni kwiya mukuni lumbekela muno mu sibaka.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Cwale Nyambe sebeli omuba oulikani no mupato. Mi cwale Abulahama sebeli oleya Isaka, ni kumubeeka ku mupato ba liywaa no mutanu ni twaatu, mi Isaka sebeli oleya Jakobo, Jakobo sebeli oleya anjekulyetu nokukwana likumi ni twiili.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>Kakuli anjekulyetu kame ana kufela minoo Josefa omuna niku muulisa mu Engepita, kono Nyambe nakwikala naye, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>mi sebeli omulamulela mu mayando aye onje niku muba okukateleha ni kushangama, balubala wa Falo Ombumu no Engepita woyo onaku muba oubusisi no Engepita ni beulu no asindoo yaye yonje.<verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Cwale sebeli kwiiya olukupwe munaha yonje no Engepita ni mu Kanana, ni mayando manene mane na shemi etu sebeli akwangwa oku wana eilya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Kono cwale Jakobo aba ana kuyupa eyo nji kame kuli eilya mu Engepita, sebeli otumako anjekulyetu akano weli.<verse eid="ACT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Ba musipili no wiili Josefa sebeli okulimukisa kwakulwaye, mi olusika lwa Josefa sebeli lulimukiwa kwa Falo <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Cwale Josefa sebeli otuma aanu okashimba sitaye Jokobo ni lusika lwaye lonje, anakukwana makumi mutanu na yili naanu mutanu (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Cwale Jakobo sebeli ota ku Engepita, nukafelako yonyene na njekulyetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Eitupu yoo kame inaku twaliwa mu Shekemu nukateuliwa mu libita anaku ula Abulahama ni mali kwaana aa Homoli namu Shekemu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>“Kono enako no sepiso aba inaku sheteta, eyo Nyambe anaku sepisa Abulahama epalo no aanu mu Egepita sebeli yekezeha onene. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Mane sebeli kuyola Ombumu munjili mu Engepita woyo nokwa limuka Josefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Woyo sebeli otenda omushobo wetu mu kushangama no kwiiba, na kuyandisa anjekulyetu, sebeli wataukisa anoo nji alese okupula afee. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>Munako eyi Mushe sebeli oleiwa, neli omwana no kuwaba onene balubala wa Nyambe. Mi kame anaku litiwa ba tikweti taatu mu ndoo ya sitaye, <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>mi ababo yosi limukiwa fela, mwanaye Falo no musizana sebeli okutolelaye, ni ukukuliseta ye nji atende mwanaye luli. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Cwale Mushe sebeli oiyetiwa okushangama konje no Aengepita mi sebeli oikala ni maata mu kwamba ni mu misebezi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>“Cwale aba ana kukwanisa emyaka makumi anee (40), sebeli oiyelwa etakazo mu mucima waye nokuta oka potela abaye aana no Isilaele. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Cwale sebeli omona omunjili no abaye yo tendiwa ouyi, sebeli omulwela, okumu lamulela mukwibaa Omuegepita. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Nakuyambuta nji abaye kame sa yupisise nji Nyambe kame saayoyise mulibaka no Lyoko lyaye, kono kaasikuyupisisa. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Cwale liywaa linaku tatamako sebeli omumonahaza kwaonyene aalwa mi sebeli waaeleza nji, ‘Alume, kame muli omwabaye munu, iikene aba mukulwisa?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Kono omulume woyo onakutenda omukwaye ouyi sebeli okasha Mushe, ni kumwibanguta nji, ‘Anyine onaku beeke omubusisi ni mwatuli wetu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>‘Kame usinga okunibaa kanyi omo unakwibaela Omuegepita bingolwa?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Mulibaka no liywi elyo, Mushe sebeli otunda mu Engepita okuta mu naha no Mindiyani, omo anokaleyelamo aana ayili.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>Cwale aba kuna mana emyaka makumi anee (40), elin̄eloi sebeli likumonahaza kwa Mushe mu lihalaupa no lilundu no Sinai, mu lulimi no mulilo mu liputa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Cwale Mushe aba anakumona ngeso sebeli okomoka, abana shetetako nji amonisise, sebeli oyupa eliywi lya Mbumu elyamba nji, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‘Time Nyambe wa njekulyowe, Nyambe wa Abulahama Nyambe wa Isaka ni wa Jakobo.’ Cwale Mushe sebeli ocila ni kukwangwa okwaliketako. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Cwale MBUMU sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, ‘Otundise etinjangwa towe ku makondo, kakuli esibaka wimanine ni sakukena. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Kame ninalikete mi kame nimono amayando no aanu ange mu Egepita mi nuyupu okutonga koo, mi kame nineyi mukwaa lukulula. Cwale wiiye, niku tume ku Egepita.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>“Mushe woyo ana kukana aamba nji, ‘Anyine ona kubeeke omubusisi ni mwatuli?’ Yokame ana beeke Nyambe omubusisi ni mulukululi woo mulibaka no lingeloi linaku monahala mu liputa.<verse eid="ACT 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Sebeli watundisa mu Egepita, yo tenda etimakazo neyi ikomokisa ni ba liwate no mucaa ni mu lihalaupa emyaka makumi anee (40). <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>Mushe yokame onakwambela aana no Isilaele nji, ‘Nyambe wenu mba mi litele omunuhi mukaci no abenu kanyi omo ana kuni beekela.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Yokame woyo onakukuwana mu lihalaupa ni lingeloi linakwamba kwa yonyene ku lilundu lya Sinai, yoli na njekulyetu, ni ku tambula amaywi a yoyisa nji atube oo.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>Kono anjekulyetu sebeli akana okumukuteka, kono sebeli amukuteka ku nyonga mu micima yoo ni kuukela ku Engepita. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa Aluni nji,‘Otutendele emilimu eyi itwenda ku lubala, kanyi Mushe woyo onaku tutwaletela okutunda mu naha no Egepita, katu limukile esi sinamwiyele.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Cwale mu maywaa awo sebeli aumba onamani, ni kutundiseta etinubu esiswaniso eso ni ku wabelelwa mu misebezi no maoko oo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Kono Nyambe sebeli wafutukela ni kwaaba oku lapelela empi nakuwilu, kanyi omo kun̄olelwe mu buka no anuhi nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Anyi asi ndoo no Isilaele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ninji kame munaku nilitela eiyamana no kuyonda ni matabelo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">emyaka inee mu lihalaupa.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Cwale kame munakushimba Endoo ya Nyambe ya Muloke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ni lutungweti lwa Nyambe Lefani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">neli amaswaniso munakukuketela okulapelela</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Cwale kame sanimitundise mu Babilona.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>“Anjekulyetu nakwikala ni tabanakele no upaki mu lihalaupa, simba kanyi woyo ona kwamba kwa Mushe nakumu laelela yonyene ona kwitenda, kanyi esiswaniso eso anaku mona. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Munyima anjekulyetu sebeli aiya mu naha ni Joshuwa ku sicaba anakucita Nyambe balubala wa anjekulyetu. Sebeli iikalamo okutwala ba maywaa a Dabida. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Dabida naku wana esishemo kwa Nyambe mi sebeli okumbela nji awanene Nyambe wa Jakobo esibaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Kono neli Solomoni ona kumuyakela endoo. <verse eid="ACT 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Kono Nyambe Omwambakani ka ikala mu tindoo tina yakiwa ni maoko, kanyi omunuhi aba anakwamba nji,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>‘Eliwilu lyokame olubona lwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">mi elitunga lyokame esipula nilyatile amakondo ange</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Mufuta ubine no ndoo muniyakela, kame kwamba MBUMU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">kamba kasibaka eso ni fanena oku pumulela?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Kasanji amaoko ange kasikuyaka einu yonje eyi?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>“Anyi anu no tindingo tisatalalile, aa ulwile okwingenyeka emicima ni matwi yenu mu mupato, enako yonje kame mukanisa Emebo No Kukena! Kanyi omo ana kwikalela anjekulyenu, naanyi momwikalele. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Anyine omunuhi wasiku yandisiwa kwa njekulyenu? mane kame anakwibaa awo anakwamba baweli nji kame sakwiye woyo no kuluka. Cwale woyo muna kubeteka niku mwibaa. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Aanyi munaku tambula omulawo wa Nyambe onaku lukululwa ku mangeloi kono kamusi kuuteula.<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okupwacauliwa kwa Setefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa einu eyi sebeli atina, ni kukweca amaeo okumu lwisa. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Kono Setefani, yo iyalile Emebo No Kukena, sebeli omona ekanya ya Nyambe ni Jesu yoimanine ku Lyoko no silyo lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “Komumone, kame nimona eliwilu eli liyatulukile ni Mwana no munu yoimanine kweli no silyo lya Nyambe!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Cwale sebeli akuwa ni liywi linene ni kutika amatwi oo ni kwitukela kwa yonyene onje, <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>niku mukokela kundee no mulenen̄i niku mupwacula ni mawee. Etipaki sebeli abeeka eikumango yoo banji, ba makondo no ndumbana wisaniwa Saule. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Cwale alemine okupwacaula Setefani, sebeli olapela nji, “Mbumu Jesu otambule Emebo yange!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Cwale sebeli okubama ni kukuwa ni liywi linene nji, “Mbumu, olese okwahupulela esibi sino!” Aba ana mana ngeso, sebeli okulanganena.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Saule naku pumena olufu lwa Setefani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saule yo yandisa Ekeleke</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Cwale ba liywaa elyo sebeli kwinguka okuyandisiwa kunene mu Ndoo ya Nyambe mu Jelusalema, mi onje kame anakuhasanela mu naha no Judeya ni Samaliya sebeli kusiyala fela Atumiwa omboci. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Alume anjili no aasikupumena sebeli ata oka pumbeka Setefani, niku mulila onene.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Kono Saule sebeli otateka okusisinya Endoo ya Nyambe, ni kwingena mu tindoo okukokamo alume na kati ni kwaaingenyeka mu tolongo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eliywi no Kuwaba sebeli likutaziwa mu Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Cwale awo anaku hasanyiwa sebeli ata alemine okukutaza eliywi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filipi sebeli ota mu mulenen̄i no Samaliya, nukaamba eyi ya Kilesite kwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Aanu nokupula sebeli aikala ni mucima mumweya okutambula eyo anakwamba Filipi, Cwale sebeli amuyupa nikumona etimakazo ana kutende. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Kakuli Emebo no kwiiba sebeli inakutunda mwaanu nokupula awo anakwingeniwa yolemine okukuwa ni liywi linene, naanu asikukutela olun̄an̄ali ni iyanga no makondo sebeli abalisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Cwale okuwabelelwa noku neneba sebeli kwikalamo omo mu mulenen̄i.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simoni onganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Kono oweli kame kunakwikala omulume onakwisaniwa Simoni onakutendanga amabibo mu tolopo no Samaliya onaku komokisanga esicaba, yonyene kame ana kukyemanga nji munu nokuneneba, <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>mi onje kame anaku mukutekanga, okutangisa ku mwanukana okutwala ku mukulu, sebeli aamba nji, “Uyu mulume ni maata a Nyambe awo aisanwa nji, ‘Amaata no kuneneba.’” <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Kame anaku mukolwa kakuli naku tangisa kale okwakomokisa ni mabibo aye. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Kono aba anaku pumena Filipi aba anakwaambela eliywi no kuwaba no muboso wa Nyambe ni litina lya Jesu Kilesite onje alume nakati sebeli akolobeziwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simba yonyene Simoni naku pumena, mi munyima no ku kolobeziwa sebeli okumalela Filipi, mi aba mona etimakazo neyi ikomokisa, sebeli okomoka.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Cwale atumiwa ku Jelusalema abaana kuyupa nji amasamaliya kame anatambula eliywi lya Nyambe, sebeli atuma Pitolosi ni Jowani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Awo abaana kukeela sebeli aalapelela nji abiwe Emebo No Kukena. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Kakuli Emebo No Kukena kaya siku shulumukela simba ku mumweya kwa onyene, kono kame anaku kolobeziwa fela mu litina lya Mbumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Cewale sebeli abeka amaoko oo beulu yoo mi sbeli atambula Emebo No Kukena.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Cwale Simoni aba aaku mona nji Emebo kame inabiwi mukubeka amaoko no atumiwa, sebeli waasepisa okwaba amali, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>ni kwamba nji, “Munibe ku maata awo, nji omunu yonje sanibeeke amaoko mba tambula Emebo No Kukenaa.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli omwambela nji, “Amali owe ofe nawo, kakuli kame onahana nji kame ofanena okula empo ya Nyambe ni mali! <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Kakwisa esi sobiwe simba esemba, mu taba eyo, kakuli omucima wowe kausiluka mu miyo a Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Obake mu uyi wowe, mi olapele Nyambe, mwendi mbufanene okulemenwa omuhupulo oli mu mucima wowe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Kakuli kame ni mona nji kame oli mu mioti no kulula onene ni mu tolongo no sibi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simoni sebeli otambula nji, “Muni lapelele kwa Nyambe, nji kakwisa esinjili kweyo mu naamba sasini kwele.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Cwale aba anakumana okupaka eliywi lya Nyambe, sebeli aukela ku Jelusalema, okakutaza eliywi no kuwaba kwaanu no kupula no masamaya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filipi ni Nduna no Muisopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Kono elin̄eloi lya Mbumu sebeli lyambela Filipi nji, “Oimane mi ote ku Mbowela, ku ndila ishetumuka ku Jelusalema okuta ku Gaza, no lihalaupa, eyo nokwa endiwangwa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Cwale sebeli oimana ni kutako, sebeli omona omulume no muisopiya, neli muumba, esikombwa sinene sa Kandasi, Ombumu no mukati no isopiya, neli omubabaleli no ufumu waye onje, neyi mu Jelusalema muku lapela <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>mi muku ukela kwaawo yoikalile mu koloi yaye yo lemine okubala mu buka no munuhi Isaya <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Emebo No Kukena sebeli yamba kwa Filipi nji, “Otwalelelele, oshetete ku koloi eyi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Cwale Filipi sebeli oitukela kwa yonyene, niku muyupa yobala mu buka no munuhi Isaya, ni kumwibanguta nji, “Kame uyupa eyo olemine okubala?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Onduna sebeli otambula nji, “Ngasibine sani yupisise, okuulwile omunu onisimweta?” mi sebeli omema Filipi okutina nji aikale naye. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Cwale ekalulo no lin̄olo anaku bala neli eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Kanyi omukoko utwaliwa mukwiibaiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">simba akana no mukoko nokwalila owoya wako aba upatuliwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">kasi yaamisa akanwa kaye.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Mu kwenisiwa, mi ekatulo yaye sebeli iimekiwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Anyine sotwesa okwa olusika lwaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">kakuli omoyo waye nautundisiwa mu litunga.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Cwale onduna sebeli oibanguta Filipi nji, “Onambele, kame ni kulapela, omunuhi aba aamba eyi, kame akwamba yonyene nji kame aamba omunjili?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Cwale Filipi sebeli oyamisa akanwa kaye ni kutangisa nelyo elin̄olo okumwambela amaywi no kuwaba a Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Cwale alemine okuta mu ndila sebeli awana abakuli ameyi, mi onduna sebeliwamba nji, “Omone, bano kame kuli ameyi. sikene esi sasini kanise oku kolobeziwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filipi sebeli wamba nji, “Nji kame opumena ni mucima wowe wonje, kame kukonahala. Nduna sebeli otambula nji, Kame ni pumena nji Jesu Kilesite ni Mwanaa Nyambe.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Onduna sebeli olaelela ekoloi okwimana, onje Filipi ni Nduna sebeli aingena mu meyi, mi Filipi sebeli kolobeza onduna. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Cwale aba anakutunda mu meyi, Emebo ya Nyambe sebeli ishimba Filipi, mi onduna nakuulwa okumona Filipi kame, cwale sebeli otwalelela mu mwendo waye yo wabelelwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Kono Filipi nokakuwana mu Azoto, yo twalelela okukutaza eliywi no kuwaba mu titolopo tonje mane sebeli okakeela ku Sizeliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Okufutuka kwa Saule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Tikezo22.6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Kono Saule yosi tukufalile okufumbela okwibaa aiyetwa no Mbumu, sebeli ota ku mupulisita omukulu <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>oka kumbela kwa yonyene aman̄olo no kuta nawo mu tindoo no milapelo naku Damaseka, nji abasa kawane anjili asi Ndila eyo, alume simba akati, aanunge ni kwalita mu Jelusalema.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Cwale Saule yo atumele okukeela ku Damaseka, ababo olumonyi lunaku tunda ku wilu sebeli lumubeeka mukaci. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Cwale sebeli okwela banji ni kuyupa eliywi elyaamba kwa yonyene nji, “Saule, Saule, iikene oniyandiseta?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Sebeli oibaguta nji, “Tiwe anyine, Mbumu?” Mbumu sebeli wamba nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">“Time Jesu woyo oyandisa.” <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>“Cwale winguke oingene mu mulenen̄i, mi mbuka simwetiwamo eyo so fanene okutenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Alume anakwenda naye kame anakwimana ni kukomoka, kakuli kame anaku yupa eliywi kono kaasiku mona omunu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Saule sebeli oinguka banji mi cwale amiyo aye abaana kutona nakukwangwa okumona omunu, cwale sebeli amulema ku Lyoko niku mulita mu Damaseka. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Mu maywaa aatu yoka mono, ni kulya simba okunwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Cwale kame kuna kwikala omwiyetwa mu Damaseka no litina lya Ananiasi. Ombumu sebeli omwambela mu pono nji, “Ananiasi.” mi sebeli otambula nji, “Yamene yauno, Mbumu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Ombumu sebeli omwambela nji, “Oimane mi ote mu ndila isaniwa nji eyi noku luka, okasaele mu ndoo ya Judasi omulume naku Tasusi no litina lya Saule. Kakuli kame alapela, <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>mi ni yonyene namono omulume wisaniwa Ananiasi mu pono yoiya niku beeka amaoko aye beulu yaya nji cwale amone kame.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Kono Ananiasi sebeli otambula nji, “Mbumu, kame nina yupu ya uyu omulume kwaanu nokupula eyi ana tende, omo ana yandisete ouyi aasikupumena owe mu Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Naaba aneyi kuno, kame ana biwi amaata okutunda kwa apulisita akulu ni kununga onje aa alapela elitina lyowe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Kono Ombumu sebeli omwambela nji, “Ote, kakuli kame ninamukete okutenda esibelekiso sange nji atwale Elitina lyange kwaa simacaba na Mbumu naana no Isilaele. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Cwale kame sanimu simwete okuneneba no kukola oko sayupe mulibaka no kuyandisa elitina lyange.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Cwale Ananiyasi sebeli ota nuka ingena mu ndoo ni kubeeka amaoko aye beulu yaye ni kwamba nji, “Minange Saule, Ombumu onaku monahaza kwa wene mu ndila nani tumu, yonyene Jesu nji omone kame mi wiyale Emebo No Kukena.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Cwale ababo esinu sikufekile kanyi amayayu sebeli situnda mu miyo aye ni kumona kame. Cwale sebeli oimana ni kukolobeziwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Cwale sebeli olya ni kuukeliwa amaata</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule yo Kutaza mu Damaseka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule sebeli oikala naiyetwa mu Damaseka amaywaa acana. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Mu ndoo no milapelo ababo sebeli okutaza nji Jesu ni Mwanaa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Onje anaku muyupa sebeli akomoka ni kwibanguta nji, “Kasa yokame onaku yandisanga ouyi anaku isananga ba litina Jesu mu Jelusalema? mane mulibaka elyo bokame aba aneyi kuno, mukwaanunga ni kwatwala kwa apulisita akulu?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Kono Saule sebeli oekeza onene mu kongola kwaye, ni kukoma aendisi no Majuda okwamonisa nji Jesu yokame Kilesite.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Cwale amaywaa nokupula abaanakubwa, amajuda sebeli asinganyeka okwibaa Saule, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>kono Saule sebeli olimuka omulelo woo. kame anaku mundamenanga munji ni ousiku ku myelo nji amwibae. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Kono aiyetwa aye sebeli amushimba ousiku oku mumatukiseta ba limota, amubekile mu litanda.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saule yoli mu Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Saule aba ana kukeela mu Jelusalema sebeli weteka nji akuwane naiyetwa, mi onje kame anaku mucila, kakuli kasiku pumena nji niyonyene neli omwiyetwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Kono Banabasi sebeli omushimba, ni kumu twala kwa atumiwa, ni kwataluseta omo anaku monena Ombumu mu ndila, woyo ona kwamba naye, nomo ana kutaleze ni maata mu Damaseka mu litina lya Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Cwale Saule sebeli oyoya noo mane nikukwendela oomo anakusingela mu Jelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>yo kutaza mukuzwafisa mu litina lya Mbumu, ni kwamba muku kanana ni Majuda ao aamba esi Gelike onyene aafumba okumwibaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Cwale abaye aba anakuyupa eyo, sebeli alita Saule kwa Sesaaliya, ni kumu fundula okuta ku Tasusi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Cwale etikeleke monje mu Judeya ni mu Galileya ni mu Samaliya sebeli tiikala mu kozo, ni kweenda mu kucila kwa Mbumu, mi kame tina kukula ni kususeziwa mu tuso no Mebo No Kukena.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi yoli mu Lida ni mu Joppa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Pitolosi yo lemine okupotela eibaka yonje no naha, sebeli oiya ni kwa asikupumena aa ayakile mu Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Omo sebeli okawana omulume no Litina lya Aneya, woyo onaku langana ba mumbeta yokola oweti no lun̄an̄ali mu myaka mutanu ni twaatu (8). <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa yonyene nji, “Aneya, Jesu Kilesite kame akubalisa, oshimbe oulangano wowe.” Ababo Aneya sebeli oinguka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Onje aa ayakile mu Lida ni Shaloni naku mumona, mi sebeli asiulukela kwa Mbumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Mu Jopa kame kuna kwikala omuiyetwa no mukati elitina lyaye neli Tabita, (okutalusa nji Dokasi) Kame ana kutendanga emisebezi no kuwaba ni tituso. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Mu maywaa ao sebeli okola ni kufa. Cwale aba anakumana okumu yowisa, sebeli akamu beeka mu musiyo na kuwilu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Lida kakuli kame ina kwikala beebi ni Jopa, aiyetwa sebeli ayupa nji Pitolosi kwaali, sebeli atuma alume ayili okamu kumbela nji, “Shangwe, ulese ku liyeha wiye kwaaci.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli oinguka nikuta noo. Aba anaku keela, sebeli amutwala ku musiyo na kuwilu, etimbelwa tonje sebeli tiimana ku nyonga yaye alemine okulila, nikumu monisa eikumango ni misisi anaku tendanga Dokasi yo siyoya noo. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli watundiseta bandee onje, sebeli okubama ni manwi banji ni kulapela, cwale nikusiulukela ku situpu ni kwamba nji, “Tabita, oinguke!” sebeli otona, mi aba anaku mona Pitolosi sebeli oikala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Pitolosi sebeli omulema ku Lyoko okumwimeka. Cwale sebeli oisana etimbelwa naa asikupumena ni kwaaba Tabita yo yoya. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Etaba eyo sebeli ilimukiwa kwaanu onje mu Jopa, mi anokupula sebeli apumena kwa Mbumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli oikala mu Jopa amaywaa nokupula ku mulume oisaniwa Simoni, omusuhi no itumba.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi ni Koneliyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Mu Sesaaliya, kame kuna kwikala omulume no litina lya Koneliyasi, omukulu no masole, no mpi iisaniwa nji, “Italiya.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Neli omunu ona kukubeeka ni kucila Nyambe nia sindoo yaye onje, kame ana kutusanga onene anokusheba mi kame ana kulapelanga enako yonje kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Ba nako no waatu omunji sebeli omona wino mu pono elin̄eloi lya Nyambe eliiya kwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Koneliyasi!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Cwale Koneliyasi sebeli waliketa elin̄eloi mukucila ni kwamba nji, “Etaba ni ibine, Mbumu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Elin̄eloi sebeli limu tambula nji, “Etitapelo ni tituso towe kwawo ashebile nati kambamene kwa Nyambe, mi natipulukiwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Cwale otume alume ku Jopa akashimbe Simoni woyo oisaniwa Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Kame ali ni Simoni omusuhi no itumba, endoo yaye kame ikubapile ni liwate.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Cwale elin̄eloi lina kwamba naye aba linakuta, sebeli oisana abika aye ayili ni musole mumweya woyo ona kukubeeka kwa Nyambe kwawo ana ku mutatelelanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Munyima ya Koneliyasi okwaambela eyi inatendahala yonje sebeli waatuma ku Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epono ya Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Eliywaa linaku tatamako, awo asili mu ndila, aali beebi ni Jopa, Pitolosi sebeli otina ba situwa no ndoo oka lapela, ba nako aba ina kukwana likumi ni twiili (12) omunji. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Pitolosi sebeli oyomba ni kusaela esino kulya, aasilemine okumu lukiseta eilya, sebeli omona epono. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Cwale sebeli omona eliwilu liyatuluka ni sinu siiya banji kanyi olwambi lunene lunungilwe ku mamaneneno yalo anee. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Mukaci yalo kame kuna kwikala emifuta yonje no iyamana neyi yenda ni mapumo ni tuyunyi na kuwilu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Cwale eliywi sebeli liiya kwa yoyene lyaamba nji, “Imana, Pitolosi, wibae mi olye!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, “Kokulwa, Mbumu, kakuli kanisilya kale esinu sonje no kwakena neyo no litilo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Eliywi sebeli liiya kwa yonyene kame akano wili nji, “Esi sikenisitwe kwa Nyambe, olese okwamba nji nisaalitilo.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Nakuku tendahala ngeso twaatu, esinu eso sebeli susetwa ku wilu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Pitolosi yosi nahana epono ana mono nji iikene, komumone, alume ana tumiwa kwa Koneliyasi munyima no kwibanguta ku ndoo ya Simoni sebeli akeela ni kwimana ba mwelo. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Cwale sebeli aisana ni kwibanguta nji, “Kana mokame muno ana tibelele Simoni wisaniwa Pitolosi?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Pitolosi yo sinahana eyi no pono eyo, Emebo sebeli yamba kwa yonyene nji, “Omone, alume aatu kame akusaela. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Wimane mi oshetumuke, ote noo oulwile oku lindalinda, kakuli time ninaa tumu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli oshetumukela kwaao alume ana tumeniwa kwa yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Yamene mu saela. Mulibaka libine aba muneeyi?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Cwale sebeli atambula nji, “Koneliyasi, omukulu no masole, kuluka, woyo ocila Nyambe ni kukutekiwa ku sicaba sonje no Majuda. Kame ana laeliwa ku lingeloi no kukena okwisanena ku ndoo yaye, nji ayupe eyo so wambe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli waatambula ni kwaingenyeka mu ndoo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Pitolosi ku ndoo ya Koneliyasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Eliywaa linaku tatamako Pitolosi sebeli ota noo, nanjili abaye namu Jopa sebeli ata naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Kweeli linaku tatamako eliywaa sebeli aingena mu Sesaaliya. Koneliyasi kame anakwa atatelela, mane kame anakwisana bamweya aa asinga onene naabaye. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Cwale Pitolosi aba anakwingena, Koneliyasi sebeli omuwaniketa niku kwela banji ni manwi ku makondo aye niku mukubamena. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli omwimeka ni kwamba nji, “Imana,” “Nimene, kame nili omunu fela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Pitolosi yo ambola ni Koneliyasi, sebeli aingena mu ndoo ni kuwanamo aanu nokupula aunganine. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Pitolosi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Aanyi kame mulimukile nji ni kulwisa omulawo omunu kakuli o Mujuda kalukele okuwana nasimacaba andina simba okulekula omunjili kwa yonyene. Kono Nyambe nanikete nji nilese okwaliketa omunu yonje nji kame aiyalile elitilo kasikena. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Cwale aba nina kutumeniwa, kame nineyi nambulwa mukwakana. Cwale kame nimi ibanguta nji, iikene munani isanene?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Koneliyasi sebeli otambula nji, “Kwabita kale amaywaa anee, Kame naikalanga mundoo yange me nilapela omunji ba nako no waatu (15:00) mi sebeli nimona omulume onaku manga eikumango no kubenya yo imanine balubala wange <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>ni kwamba nji, ‘Koneliyasi okulapela kowe naku yupahala mi ni tituso towe na tihupuliwa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Cwale otumene ku Jopa mi okaisane Simoni no litina lya Pitolosi, kame ali mu ndoo ya Simoni osikusuha eitumba, eyi ili beebi ni liwate.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Cwale bokame aba nina leluba ookutumena, mi nutende wino aba uneyi. Cwale tonje kame tuli bamweya balubala wa Nyambe, oku yupa eyo ona laelwe yonje kwa Mbumu okutwambela.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Engambolo Ya Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli oyatulula akanwa kaye ni kwamba nji, “Niti luli kame nilemuha nji Nyambe kakete omunu omo aikalele. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Kono mu sicaba ni sicaba munu yonje woyo omucila ni kutenda eyi ilukile, kame alumelelwa kwa yonyene. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Kame mulimukile elin̄usa anaku tuma kwaana a Isilaele, okwa kutaza eliywi no kuwaba no kozo ya Jesu Kilesite Ombumu no aanu onje. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Kame mulimukile eyo ineyi mu Judeya monje eyi inaku tangisa mu Galileya munyima ya Jowani oku kutaza ei no kolobezo. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Kame mulimukile Nyambe omo anaku wabela Jesu wa Nazaleta ni Mebo no Kukena ni maata, ao anaku tendisa einu no kuwaba niku balisa aanu onje awo anakwi kalanga munji no maata a Satani, kakuli Nyambe kame ana kwikala naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Cwale kame tuli apaki kwiinu yonje anaku tenda bamweya mu naha no Majuda ni mu Jelusalema. Kame ana mwibaa, okumu tuleka. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Kono Nyambe naku mwingula ba liywaa no waatu ni kumuba oku monahala, <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>kasa kwaanu onje kono kwaaci anaku yulekiwa kwa Nyambe okutenda apaki, awo anakulya ni kunwa naye munyima no kwinguka kwaafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Kame ana tulaelele okukutaza kwaanu ni kupaka nji yokame ona ketiwa kwa Nyambe oku tenda omwatuli no asikuyoya naa sikufa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Kwayonyene anuhi a Nyambe onje kame apaka nji munu yonje so pumena kwa yonyene kame sa tambule okulemenwa eibi mu litina lyaye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asimacaba aba anaku tambula Emebo no Kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Abo Pitolosi yo saamba eyi, Emebo No Kukena sebeli ishetumuka beulu no aanu onje awo ana yupu eliywi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Aasikupumena mwa onyene asimupato ana kwiiya ni Pitolosi sebeli akomoka, kakuli empo no Mebo No Kukena naitelwe simba kwaa siacaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Kakuli kame ana kwayupa aamba mu tipuo tindina oku lumbeka Nyambe. Cwale Pitolosi sebeli wamba nji, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>“Kana kame kuli omunu so kanena aa aanu oku kolobeziwa ni meyi aa ana tambula Emebo No Kukena kanyi aaci?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Cwale sebeli waalaela nji akolobeziwe mu litina lya Jesu Kilesite. Sebeli amukumbela okwikala noo amaywaa acana.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Epiho ya Pitolosi ku Keleke ku Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Cwale Atumiwa naaasikupumena awo ali mu Judeya sebeli ayupa nji asimacaba nonyene kame ana tambula eliywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Cwale Pitolosi aba nata ku Jelusalema, onyene asimupato sebeli amuzekisa nji, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>“Iikene aba onati kwaalume aa kasita ku mupato ni kulya noo!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Kono Pitolosi sebei otangisa okwaataluseta mu utungi nji,<verse eid="ACT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>“Kame nina kwikala mu mulenen̄i wa Jopa meni lapela, mi muku hapiwa sebeli ni mona epono no sinu simonahala okwiiya banji kanyi olwambi no kuneneba olu lunungilwe ku mamaneneno anee, mane ni kwiiya kwa mene. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Aba nishetetako okwaliketa, sebeli ni mona eiyamana ni ibatana neyi yeenda ni mapumo ni iyunyi naku wilu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Cwale sebeli ni yupa eliywi elyamba kwa mene nji, ‘Oimane, Pitolosi, oibae mi olye!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Kono sebeli naamba nji, ‘Kokuulwa Mbumu! Kakuli asimbakwatanga kakwisa esi no matilo simba nokwakena esi sina ingene mu kanwa kange.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Kono eliywi sebeli litambula aka no wiili okutunda ku wilu nji, ‘Eso ana kenisa Nyambe kaufanene okusi isana nji litilo.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Esi kame sinaku tendahala kaatu, mi einu eyo yonje sebeli yukela ku wilu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Ba nako eyo alume aatu sebeli akeela ku ndoo omo tuna kwikala, anaku tumenwa kwa mene okutunda kwa Sesaaliya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Cwale Emebo sebeli inambela nji nite noo, okuulwile okuba elibaka. Abaange mutanu ni mumweya sebeli ata nange, mi nuukaingena mu ndoo no mulume woyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Cwale sebeli otwambela omo ana kumonena elin̄eloi eli imanine mu ndoo yaye ni kwamba nji, ‘Waatume ku Jopa mi akalonde Simoni woyo oisaniwa Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Kame saambe kwa wene elin̄usa elyo saaliku yoyise, wene naasindoo yowe onje.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Nji ni tangise okwamba, Emebo No Kukena sebeli ishulumukela beulu yoo kanyi omo ina kwiyela kwaaci ku matatekelo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Cwale sebeli ni puluka eliywi lya Mbumu, omo ana kwambela nji, ‘Jowani naku kolobeza ni meyi, kono anyi mbamu kolobeziwa ni Mebo No Kukena.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Nji cwale Nyambe nakwaaba etimpo no kukufeka kanyi eto anakutuba aba tuna kupumena mwa Jesu Kilesite time anyine cwale nji nikanene Nyambe!”<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Cwale aba anaku yupa eyi, sebeli akwa emicima ni ku kanyisa Nyambe aamba nji, “Cwale kwa simacaba Nyambe naabi ngeeso okubaka no moyo.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekeleke mu Antiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Cwale awo anaku hasana mulibaka no mayando ana kwiiya ba nako ana kweenda Setefani okakeela ku Foenisiya ni ku Sipulasi ni ku Antiyoki, aulwile okwamba eliywi kumunu yonje konji ku Majuda omboci. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Kono kame kuna kwikala anjili kwa onyene, alume naku Sipulasi ni ku Sileni nakwiiyanga ku Antiyoki mu kwambola ni Mangelike, oku kutaza eliywi lya Mbumu Jesu kwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Amaata a Mbumu na kwikala noo, mi ni palo no kupula awo ana kupumena sebeli asiulukela kwa Mbumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Elin̄usa no eyi sebeli liiya mukuyupahala mu Ndoo ya Nyambe na mu Jelusalema, mi sebeli atuma Banabasi ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela ni kumona esishemo sa Nyambe, sebeli owabelelwa ni kwasusueza onje nji aongotete kwa Mbumu ni mucima no ku tundamena. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Kakuli neli mulume no kuwaba, nokwiyala Emebo no Kukena ni tumelo. Cwale aanu no kupula sebeli aekezeha kwa Mbumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Cwale Banabasi sebeli ota kwa Tesasi oka saela Saule. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Cwale aba anaku muwana, sebeli omulita ku Antiyoki. Kame ana kwikalamo omwaka aakuwana ni Ndoo ya Nyambe ni kwiyeta aanu no kupula onene. Mu Antiyoki aiyetwa neli ano weli okwisaniwa nji aasikupumena.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Cwale mu maywaa aa, anuhi a Nyambe sebeli aiya okutunda ku Jelusalema okuta ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Cwale omunjili mwa onyene ona kwisaniwa nji Angabusi sebeli wimana ni kwamba ni Mebo nji kame sakwikale elishebo linene mu litunga lyonje, mi eyi kame inaku tendahala mu nako ya Kilaundiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Aiyetwa sebeli alela oku twalela aasikupumena ayakile mu Judeya etituso omunu ni munu oku tundisa omwa tweseta monje. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Cwale sebeli atenda ngeso, mi niku tumena akulu no Ndoo ya Nyambe , mu maoko a Banabasi ni Saule.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Amayando no Kupula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Mu nako eyo Ombumu Heloda sebeli otangisa oku yandisa anjili no Ndoo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Sebeli oibaa Jakobo minaye Jowani ni sabule. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Cwale aba ana kumona nji aendisi no Majuda na wabelelwa, sebeli wekeza okununga ni yonyene Pitolosi. Eyi neli mu maywaa no inkwa na mbulwa omumena. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okumununga, sebeli omu beeka mu tolongo ni kumuba mu maoko no ikwata inee no masole, mi kame ana kulela oku mubeeka balubala noanu munyima no Paseka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Cwale Pitolosi kame ana kuteulwa mu tolongo, kono Endoo ya Nyambe kaisiku lesele oku mulapelela mukusepahala kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aba nalukululwa mu Tolongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Ousiku owo luli abo Heloda yo hupula nji amulite bandee kwaanu, Pitolosi kame nalangananga mukaci no masole ayili yo nungilwe amawenge ayili, mi atateleli ayili aali ba mwelo no tolongo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Cwale komumone, elin̄eloi lya Mbumu sebeli limonahala, mi eliseli sebeli limonahala mu tolongo, mi sebeli likuba Pitolosi ku timaci ni kumwingula okumwambela nji, “Oinguke mu wangu.” Amawenge sebeli akwa ku maoko aye. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Cwale elin̄eloi sebeli limwambela nji, “Okufuke mi okumange amakatulo owe.” mi sebeli otenda ngeso, elin̄eloi sebeli limwambela nji, “Okufuke omukanjo wowe mi onikon̄e.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Cwale sebeli obana ni kukon̄a elin̄eloi, kasiku limuka nji elin̄eloi eyi litenda niya luli, kono yonyene kame anaku nahana nji kame amona epono. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Cwale aba anakusiya omutateleli no weli ni uyu no wili, sebeli akeela ba mweelo no sondo ou ota mu mulenen̄i. Omweelo sebeli oku yatulula wenyene kwa onyene, mi sebeli atundamo ni kwenda mu ndila, cwale ababo elin̄eloi sebeli limusiya.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Cwale Pitolosi sebeli olemuha yonyene ni kwamba nji, “Bano cwale kame ni yii nji ni niti! Mbumu na tumu elingeloi lyaye oku nilukulula mu maoko a Heloda ni kweyo yonje ana kutatelela aanu no Majuda.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Cwale aba anaku lemuha sebeli ota ku ndoo ya Maliya, inawaye Jowani no litina linjili lya Maleka, omo ana kuungana ano kupula alemine okulapela. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Cwale abana kokota ba saandi no mweelo, omubika oisaniwa Loda sebeli oiya mukutambula. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Aba ana kulimuka eliywi lya Pitolosi, yo wabelelwe kasiku yatulula omweelo kono sebeli oituka okuta mukaci okaamba nji Pitolosi uno, kame aimanine ba mweelo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Kame otakana!” Kono yonyene sebeli ongoteta nji yokame. Sebeli aamba nji, “Ni lingeloi lyaye.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Kono Pitolosi sebeli otwalelela okukokota, mi aba anaku yatulula sebeli amumona mi sebeli akomoka. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Kono sebeli waakobeta ni Lyoko nji aondoke, mi sebeli waatolokela omo ana mutundisete Mbumu mu tolongo. Mi sebeli wamba nji, “Mu simwete Jakobo naaasikupumena etaba eyi.” Cwale sebeli waasiya ni kuta ku sibaka sinjili.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Cwale aba kunakupa, sebeli kwikala omufilifili munene mukaci no masole kweeyo ina tendahala kwa Pitolosi. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Cwale Heloda aba ana kumusaela mi sebeli okwangwa okumuwana, sebeli ozekisa aatateleli ni kulaela nji kame afanena okufa. Cwale Heloda sebeli otunda mu Judeya okuta mu Sesaaliya oka ikalamo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elifu lya Heloda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Cwale Heloda onaku tinena aanu namu Tile ni Sidoni, cwale sebeli aiya kwa yonyene aali muumweya onje mi aba anaku twesa okususueza Bulasitasi esikombwa sa Mbumu, sebeli akumbela ekozo. Kakuli eilya yoo kame inakutundanga mu naha ya Mbumu.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Ba liywaa linaku ketiwa Heloda sebeli okufuka eikumango no umbumu ni kwikala mu lubona lwaye, mi sebeli wamba kwaanu mu umbumu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Aanu sebeli akuweleza nji, “Eliywi eli lya mulimu, kasa lya munu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Ababo elin̄eloi lya Nyambe sebeli limufula, kakuli kasiku kanyisa Nyambe, sebeli oliwa ku mibila ni kufa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Kono eliywi lya Nyambe sebeli likula ni kwekezeha.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Cwale Banabasi ni Saule sebeli auka ku Jelusalema aba anakumana okwiyateteta omusebezi woo, sebeli aiya ni Jowani no litina linjiili lya Maleka.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Banabasi ni Saule aba anaku Ketiwa ni ku Tumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Cwale mu Ndoo ya Nyambe namu Antiyoki kame kuna kwikala aanuhi naaiyeti, Banabasi, Simyoni ona kwisaniwa Nija, Lusiusi namu Sileni ni Manaeni omunjili no manduna no kuta ya Heloda omubusisi ni Saule. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Abo alemine oku kubamena Ombumu ni kukuyumena eilya, Emebo No Kukena sebeli yaamba nji, “Muni ketele Banabasi ni Saule atende omusebezi owo ninaa isanene.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okuuyumena eilya ni kulapela sebeli abeeka amaoko woo beulu yoo ni kwaafundula<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Sipulasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Cwale, bakutumiwa ku Mebo No Kukena sebeli ata ku Selusia, mi okutunda abo sebeli alutela mu Sipulasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Cwale aba anoka keela mu Salamisi, sebeli aaka kutaza eliywi lya Nyambe mu tindoo no ilapelo no Majuda. Kame ana kweenda ni Jowani ona kwaatusanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Cwale aba anaende mu sooli mane okakeela ku Pafosi, sebeli akuwana ni mulume no mabibo, omunuhi no mapwa no Majuda no Litina lya Bal-Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Kame ana kwikalanga ku mubusisi Selgiusi Paulusi, omulume no kushangama. Woyo sebeli oisana Banabasi ni Saule na kulakaza okuyupa eliywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Kono Elimasi no mabibo (kakuli neli yonyene etaluso no litina lyaye) sebeli wahanyeza, ni kweteka okukanisa omubusisi nji alese okupumena. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Kono Saule, woyo wisaniwa kame nji Paulusi, sebeli wiyala ni Mebo No Kukena mi sebeli omwaliketa <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>ni kwamba nji, “Weene omwana no kwiiba, wene esila no inu yonje nokuluka, wene wiyalile ouyi onje, kaulesele okusinya endila no kooloka ya Mbumu! <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Cwale omone, elyoko lya Mbumu kame lili beulu yowe, kame sotende esibofu mi uulwe okumona eliywaa ba nako icana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ababo okwilola ni uwi sebeli ifuka amiyo aye, mi sebeli osaela omunu no kumwendisa ni Lyoko. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Cwale omubusisi sebeli opumena aba ana kumona esi sineeyi, kakuli kame ana kukomokisiwa ku tuto ya Mbumu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Antiyoki namu Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Cwale Paulusi naa ana kwenda noo sebeli atunda mu Pafosi ni kuta okakeela ni ku Pega namu Pamfiliya. Mi Jowani sebeli waasiya ni kuuka ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Kono onyene sebeli atunda mu Pega nuuka keela mu Antiyoki namu Pisidiya, mi ba liywaa no Pumulo sebeli aingena mu ndoo no milapelo nuu ka ikala banji. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Munyima no ku bala omulawo naanuhi a Nyambe, aendisi no ndoo no milapelo sebeli aatumena omunu ona kwamba nji, “Abaange, nji kame muli ni liywi no kususuweza aanu, mu lyaambe.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli oimana, mi yo kobetite ni Lyoko, sebeli wamba nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Alume no Isilaele, naanyi mucila Nyambe, komuteetete! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Nyambe no aanu aa no Isilaele kame ana kukuketela asitetu ni kwaakulisa asiikalile mu naha no Engepita, ni Lyoko no kwimana sebeli waatundisamo, <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>cwale mu myaka no kukwana makumi anee (40) sebeli oyanda noo mu lihalaupa. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okuyundisa amasika mutanu naayili mu naha no Kanana, mi sebeli waaba enaha yoo kanyi ayooli. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Cwale munyima nweeyo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Sebeli waaba aatuli okutwala ba nako no munuhi wa Nyambe Samwele, mi kame sina kushimba emyaka ina kukwana emwenda inee ni makumi atanu (450). <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Cwale aba anaku kumbela nji abiwe ombumu, Nyambe sebeli waaba Saule omwana Kishi, omulume no lusika lwa Benjamine, ni kubusa emyaka inakukwana makumi anee (40). <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Cwale aba ana kumana oku mutundisa, sebeli oimeka Dabida okutenda ombumu woo, yonaku pakiwa ni kwamba eyaye nji, ‘Kame nina wana Dabida omwana Jese, omulume woyo okolwisa omucima wange, woyo sotenda eyo nisinga yonje.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Mu lusika no mulume uyu Nyambe na liti omuyoyisi no Isilaele, yonyene Jesu, kanyi omo ana kusepiseza. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Cwale Jesu yo kasiiya kale Jowani yo wakutaza kale ekolobezo no kubaka kwaanu onje no Isilaele. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Cwale Jowani yoli beebi niku mana omusebezi waye, sebeli nji, ‘Ngasibine muyambuta nji time anyine? Kasa mene yonyene. Kokuulwa, kono munyima yange omunjili okeile, simba etinjatangwa naku makodo aye sitwese okwa nungutula.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>“Abaange, aanu no lusika lwa Abulahama naanyi monje aa acila Nyambe, kwaaci na kwiiyi elin̄usa no kuyoyisa. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Kakuli awo ayoya mu Jelusalema naa endisi oo, mulibaka nji kasi limuka Jesu simba okwayupa amaywii no anuhi a Nyambe aa abaliwa ba liywaa ni liywaa eli no Pumulo, naiyateetete eyi no kumwatula. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Simba nji kasikuwana omubonda owo ofanena elifu, sebeli akumbela Pilato kwalukulwela yonyene nji aibaiwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwiiyateteta eyo inakun̄oliwa eyaye, sebeli amutundisa ba sitondo ni kumu langeka mu libita. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Kono Nyambe naku mwiingula kwaafu, <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>ni kumoniwa mu maywaa no kupula kwaao ana kwiiya naye okutunda ku Galileya okuta ku Jelusalema, awo atendile cwale apaki aye kwaanu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Cwale na tumilitele eliywi no kuwaba elyo Nyambe ana kusepisa kwaa njekulyetu nji, <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>esi ana iyatetete mwaaci anoo mu kwingula Jesu, kanyi kame omo kun̄olelwe mu Lismu no wiili nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Tiwe Mwanange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">balelo kame nina kuleye.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Cwale esisupo no niti aba ana mwingula kwaafu, nji katamba kuukela okoola, ya naamba Nyambe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Kame sa nikube okukena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">ni timbuyoti no niti tina kusepisiwa kwa Dabida.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Cwale ni mu lisamu linjili nakwambiwa nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Kutamba kupumenena woyo no kukena wowe nji amone okoola.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Kakuli Dabida aba ana kumana okusebeza mu maywaa aye eso sina kusaelwa kwa Nyambe, sebeli ofa, ni kulangekwa kwa sitaye, ni kumona okoola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Kono woyo anaingula Nyambe, katamba kumona okoola. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>Cwalehe Abange, mu limuke nji, mwa yonyene woyo mulume na mwambeliwa oku lemenwa eibi yenu, <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>mwa yonyene omunu yonje woyo opumena kame alukululwa ku inu yonje eyo kamutwese oku lukululwa mu mulawo wa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Mu tokomele nakubu, nji cwale mu lese okwiyelwa kweyo inambiwa kwaanuhi nji,<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>‘Komumone, anyi akamashungu, mu komoke, mi mufe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Kakuli kame ni tenda omusebezi mu maywaa enu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">omusebezi samuulwe oku pumena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">naba sami talusete woo omunu!’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Aba ana kusinga okubanamo, aanu sebeli akumbela nji atalusete einu eyo afanena okutalusetwa eli no Pumulo linjili. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Cwale asi mukopano aba ana kufundulwa, aendisi no Majuda no kupula na pulosebelite awo asebeleza Nyambe sebeli akon̄a Paulusi ni Banabasi, awo sebeli aambola noo, ni kwakutaza okongoteta mu sishemo sa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Eli no Pumulo lina kutatamako omunu yonje namu mulenen̄i sebeli oiya mukuungana bamweya mukuyupa eliywi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Kono aendisi no Majuda aba ana kumona elikwanamunu, sebeli ayupa omuna, ni ku kanana eyo ina kwambiwa kwa Paulusi, ni ku mushendoola. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Cwale Paulusi ni Bananbasi sebeli aambela mukwacila nji, “Kame ku lukeele nji eliywi lya Nyambe lyambelwe anyi oweli. Kono aba mulikana kame mukwatula mwenyene nji kamu fanenwe omooyo no kwaabwa, komumone, kame tusiulukela kwa simacaba. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Kakuli cwale Ombumu natu laelele nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Kame nina kutumu nji otenda eliseli no asimacaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">nji olita oku yoyisa mu litunga lyonje okutwala ku mamaneneno.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Cwale asimacaba aba ana kuyupa ngeso, sebeli awabelelwa, ni kukanyisa eliywi lya Nyambe, mi ano kupula aa ana ketelwe omoyo no kwaabwa, sebeli apumena.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Cwale eliywi lya Mbumu sebeli lihasana mu silalanda sonje eso. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Kono aendisi no Majuda sebeli asusueza akati aa aketukiwa naalume abusai no mulenen̄i, ni kwingulela Paulusi ni Banabasi amayando, mi sebeli aacita mu naha yoo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Kono onyene sebeli atutula eliluli ku makondo oo, ni kuta ku Ikoniyamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Cwale aiyetwa sebeli aiyala okuwabelelwa ni Mebo no Kukena.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Mu Ikoniyamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Cwale mu Ikoniyamu sebeli aingena bamweya mu ndoo no milapelo no Majuda, aba ana kwambamo eliywi, epalo no kupula sebeli ipumena bamweya ku Majuda niku Mangelike <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Kono aendisi no Majuda anokwa pumena sebeli asusueza asimacaba, mi ni kwafilikanya emicima okulwisa aasikupumena. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Cwale sebeli aikalamo enako no kuleba, aamba eyi no Mbumu mukwacila, awo aaba oupaki ku liywi no sishemo saye, mukutenda eisupo neyi ikomokisa ni maoko oo. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Kono aanu namu mulenen̄i kame anokutaba, anjili ku lineku no Majuda anjili ku lineku no atumiwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Cwale omufilifili aba una kutendiwa ku Majuda bamweya na asimacaba, naa endisi oo, aba ana kusinga nji akatende asiku pumena ouyi ni kwaafula ni mawee. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Atumiwa aba anaku lemuha etaba eyo, sebeli acilela ku Lisitila ni ku Deba emulenen̄i namu Likaoniya, ni mu naha ikubapile nayo. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Omo sebeli akutazamo eliywi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Lisitila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Cwale mu Lisitila kame kuna kwikalanga omulume onaku leiwa yoli esiyanga no makondo, neli esiyanga okutunda ba kuleiwa kwaye. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Yonyene kame ana kuteteta Paulusi yo aamba. Paulusi sebeli omwaliketa, mi sebeli omona nji kame ali ni tumelo nji abalisiwe <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>cwale sebeli omwambela ni liywi no kuneneba nji, “Oimane ni makondo owe!” mi sebeli omatuka ni kweenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Cwale enyangela aba ina kumona eyo ana kutenda Paulusi, sebeli atangisa okukuwa mu puo no Silikaniya nji, “emilimu kame ineyi kwaaci mu sumbiwa sikufeka kanyi aanu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Banabasi kame anaku mubeeka elitina lya Zeusi, Paulusi neli lya Hemasi, kakuli neli yonyene omukulu ku kwamba. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Omupulisita, no ndoo ya Zeusi onyambe woo eyo inakwikala balubala no mulenen̄i, sebeli olita amapulu akabisitwe ni tipalisa ba myelo kame anaku singa okutenda esitabelo bamweya naanu.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Kono atumiwa Banabasi ni Paulusi aba ana kuyupa eyo, sebeli akaola eikumango yoo, mi sebeli aitukela mukaci no aanu no kupula alemine okukuwa nji, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>“Alume, ikene aba mutenda ngesi? naaci tuli alume kanyi aanyi, mi kame tuna militele amaywi no kuwaba, nji kame mufanena okusiuluka okutunda ku inu eyi no mbulwa tuso okuta kuwa Nyambe no kuyoya woyo ona kutenda eliwilu ni litunga, ni liwate, neyo yonje ilimo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Mu tinako naku nyima kame ana ku lumelelanga aanu onje okwenda mu mikwa yoo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Nabakulingeso, kasikulesela okuba oupaki kakuli kame anatende wino ni kumiba ombula na kuwilu ni tinako no kukutula, okumiba eilya ni kwiiiyata emicima yenu oku wabelelwa.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Mu maywi aa kasikutwesa aanu okwakanisa okwatendela eitabelo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Kono sebeli kwiiya aendisi no Majuda ana kutunda mu Antiyoki ni mu Ikoniyamu, ni kusususweza aanu, sebeli afula Paulusi ni mawee ni ku mukoka oku mutundisa mu mulenen̄i mu kuhupula nji nafu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Kono aiyetwa sebeli amubeeka mukaci mi sebeli oinguka ni kwingena mu mulenen̄i. Ba liywaa linaku tatamako sebeli ota ni Banabasi ku Deba.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuukela ku Antiyoki mu Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okukutaza eliywi mu mulenen̄i owo, ni kuwana aiyetwa no kupula sebeli aukela ku Lisitila ni ku Ikoniyamu ni ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Kame ana kongota emicima no aiyetwa ni kwaa susuweza nji atundamene mu tumelo, ni kwamba nji kame tufanena okwingena mu mayando no kupula nji twingene mu mubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okuketa akulu mu keleke ni keleke, ni kulapela nuukuyumena eilya, sebeli aasiya mu sishemo no Mbumu woyo ana ku pumena mwa yonyene.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Cwale sebeli abita mu naha no Pisidiya ni kuta ku Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba amaywi mu Pega, sebeli ata ku Ataliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>cwale okutunda abo sebeli alutela ku Antiyoki, omo ana kubeekiwa mu sishemo sa Nyambe mu musebezi owo ana kwiyateteta.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela, sebeli awaneka Ekeleke bamweya ni kwamba yonje eyo Nyambe ana tende noo, nomo ana yatulwele omweelo no tumelo no asimacaba. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Cwale sebeli aikala enako no kuleba naaiyetwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Omukopano ku Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Kono anjili alume ana kwiiya oku tunda mu Judeya sebeli aiyeta aasikupumena nji, “Aba kamwaingene mu mupato okuta mu mulawo wa Mushe, ka mu tamba okuyoisiwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Cwale Paulusi ni Banabasi abaana kukanana noo onene, Paulusi ni Banabasi naanjili ngeso sebeli ayulekiwa nji ate ku Jelusalema kwaatumiwa naakulu akambole etaba eyo.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Cwale Endoo ya Nyambe sebeli yaafundula ngeso, sebeli ata endila no kubita mu Foenisiya bamweya ni mu Samaliya, alemine okwamba eyi no ku siuluka no asimacaba, mi sebeli aaba okuwabelelwa no kuneneba kwa asikupumena onje. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Cwale aba ana kwiiya ku Jelusalema, sebeli atambuliwa kwaatumiwa ni keleke, ni kwaakulu, mi sebeli atalusa yonje eyo ana kutenda Nyambe mwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Kono aasikupumena anjili ao ali ku seemba no Afalisi sebeli aimana ni kwamba nji, “Esi sifanena ni kwatwala ku mupato, ni kwaa laela nji akuteke omulawo wa Mushe.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Atumiwa naakulu sebeli akuwana bamweya okutatuba etaba eyi. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Cwale munyima no kwaambota onene, Pitolosi sebeli oimana nikwamba nji, “Abaange, kame mulimukile nji mu maywaa ana kubwa Nyambe na kuniketa mukaci kenu nji mulibaka no kanwa kange asimacaba kame afanena okuyupa eliywi lya Nyambe ni kupumena. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Cwale Nyambe woyo olimukile emicima yoo, kame aapaka mu kwaaba Emebo No Kukena kanyi omo ana tendele kwaaci. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Kasi tenda eshutano mukaci ketu nonyene, kono kame anaakenisa ni tumelo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Cwalehe, iikene aba mweteka Nyambe mu kubeeka ecoko mu tindingo no aiyetwa eyo ana kwangwa anjekulyetu simba eyo natukutwesa okushimba? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Cwale kame tupumena nji kame satu yoyisiwe mu sishemo sa Mbumu Jesu, kanyi omo sayoyisetwe nonyene.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Cwale esikwata sonje sebeli sondoka mi kame ana kuyupeteta kwa Banabasi ni Paulusi aba ana kutalusa etiponiso ni timakazo eto Nyambe ana kutenda mwa onyene mukaci no asimacaba. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Munyima aba ana kumana okwamba, Jakobo sebeli otambula nji, “Abaange muteetete kwa mene! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Simoni sebeli otalusa omo Nyambe ana ku tangiseta oweli okupotela asimacaba, nji mukaci koo akuketele aanu aa afanena elitina lyaye. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Eyambo eyi kame ilumelelana ni maywi no anuhi a Nyambe, kanyi omo kun̄olelwe nji,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>‘Munyima no eyi, kame sa nuuke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">mi kame sa ni yake esibaka ana kuyoya Dabida , eso sinakwi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Kame sani yake ba matota no kale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">mi kame sani wiimeke.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Nji aanu ana siyalako asaele Mbumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">naa simacaba onje awo ana isaniwa mulibaka no litina lyange.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Kame kwamba Mbumu, woyo ona kutenda einu eyi nji ilimukiwe okutunda ku matatekelo.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Abakulingeso, ekatulo yange ninji, “Katu fanene oku kataza asimacaba awo asiulukela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Kono kame tufanena okwaan̄olela nji atunde kweyi no litilo no maswaniso, ni kuuhule, ni kweyi no kowiwa, ni ku unyinga. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Kakuli okutunda ku nako na kukale mu mulenen̄i ni mulenen̄i kame kuli ao akutaza eyi no milao ya Mushe eli no Pumulo neli no Pumulo mu tindoo no milapelo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elin̄olo kwaa Simacaba no Alumeli Okutunda ku Kuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Cwale kame kuli wino atumiwa naakulu ni keleke yonje, okuketa alume okutunda mwaonyene ni kwaatuma ku Antiyoki bamweya ni Paulusi ni Banabasi. Sebeli atuma Juda woyo oisanwa nji Banabasi, ni Sailasi, alume abusa mukaci no aasikupumena, <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>ni kwatumena elin̄olo linjili eli lyamba nji, “Abaange, atumiwa bamweya naakulu, nikwaaasikupumena nwa simacaba mu Antiyoki ni mu Siliya ni mu silisiya, mulumele. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Kakuli na tuyupu nji aanu anjili ana tundu mwaaci kame ana mishupu ni maywi, oka mifilikanya emicima yenu, simba nji katwasikwa laela ngeso. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Naku monahala wino mwaaci, aba tuna lumelelana bamweya, okuketa alume okwatuma kwaanyi naa singiwa etu Banabasi ni Paulusi, <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>alume ana ku toboha omoyo woo mulibaka lya Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Cwalehe natu mitumene Judasi ni Sailasi, awo onyene mbami talusete einu imweya mu liywi no kanwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Kakuli na kumonahala wino ku Mebo no kukena ni kwaaci okwamibeeka omushimbo no kuneneba okubita eyi einu no utokwa, <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>nji mukulya kweyo ina tendiwa esitabelo ku maswaniso neyi itunda ku unyinga ni kweyi no kowiwa neyi itunda mu uhule. Nji kame okuteula wenyene kweeyi, mbu tende wino. Musiyale wino.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Cwale aba ana kufundulwa awo, sebeli ata ku Antiyoki, niku waneka bamweya emikopano ni kwaaba elin̄olo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Cwale aba ana ku libala, sebeli awabelelwa onene ku maywi alyo no susuezo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Cwale Judasi ni Sailasi, awo ana kutenda onyene aanuhi a Nyambe, sebeli asusueza aasikupumena ni maywi no kupula ni kwaaongota. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Cwale aba ana kwikalamo enako no kuleba, sebeli afundulwa mu kozo kwaaasikupumena awo ana kwafundula.<verse eid="ACT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Kono Sailasi sebeli osinga oku siyala.<verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Kono Paulusi ni Banabasi sebeli asiyala mu Antiyoki, aiyeta ni kukutaza eliywi lya Mbumu, bamweya naanjili ano kupula.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi ni Banabasi aba ano Kutaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Cwale munyima no maywaa anjili, Paulusi sebeli wambela Banabasi nji, “Wiiye, tuuke tukapotele aasikupumena mu mulenen̄i ni mulenen̄i omo tuna kwambanga eliywi lya Mbumu, ni kumona omo ayoyela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Cwale Banabasi sebeli osinga okushimba Jowani woyo oisaniwa nji Maleka. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli onahana nji alese okushimba omunu ona kwaasiya asili mu Pamfiliya, mi kasi kuta noo mu musebezi woo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Cwale sebeli kwinguka efapano no kuneneba, mane sebeli akutaba, Banabasi sebeli oshimba Maleka ni ku lutela mu Sipulasi, <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>kono Paulusi sebeli oketa Sailasi ni ku funduka, yo beekilwe mu sishemo no Mbumu kwaaasikupumena. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Cwale sebeli ota mu Seliya ni mu Silisiya, yo ongota etikeleke namo.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Timoteya yota ni Paulusi ni Sailasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Paulusi sebeli wiiya mu Deba ni ku Lisitila. Omo kame ku na kwikalanga omwiyetwa, no litina lya Timoteya. Omwana no mukati no Mujuda omuasikupumena, kono sitaye neli omungelike <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Kame ana kupakiwa wino kwaa asikupumena na mu Lisitila ni mu Ikoniyamu, <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Paulusi kame ana ku saela Timoteya nji amu sindekete, mi sebeli omushimba ni ku mubeeka ku mupato mulibaka no Majuda ana kwiikalanga mu ibaka eyo, kakuli kame ana kulimuka nji sitaye neli mungelike <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Aali mu musipili woo okuta ku milenen̄i, sebeli alaela aaasikupumena nji amamele omulawo ana kubeeka atumiwa naakulu awo ana kwikalnga mu Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Cwale etikeleke kame tina kongotiwa mu tumelo, ni kwekeza ku palo mu liywaa ni liywaa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epono ya Paulusi no mulume naku Mesodoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Cwale sebeli ata mu naha no Filinjiya ni mu Galatiya, kakuli Emebo No Kukena kame ina kwaakanisa okwamba amaywi mu Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Cwale aba ana kwiiya okusheeteta amabapa ni Misiya, sebeli a saela okuta mu Betiniya, kono Emebo ya Jesu kaisikwa alumelela. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okweenda mu naha no Misiya, sebeli ashetumukela ku Tulowasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Paulusi sebeli omona epono mu usiku, omulume naku Mesodoniya yo imanine yo mu kumbela ni kwamba nji, “Wiiye mu Mesodoniya mukututusa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okumona epono eyo, Ababo sebeli tuku tukiseta mu wangu okuta ku Mesodoniya, me tunahana nji Nyambe kame ana twisanene oka kutazamo eliywi kwa onyene.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Filipi, Okufutuka kwa Lidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Aba tuna kufuula okutunda mu Tulowasi, sebeli tuta ku Samotilasi, eliywaa lina kutatamako sebeli tukafuweka mu Ne-yapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Aba tuna kutundamo sebeli tukaingena mu Filipi, omulenen̄i no weli mu sikiliti no Mesodoniya, kame ni koloni no Maloma. Sebeli twiikalamo amaywaa no mupula. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Cwale ba liywaa no Pumulo sebeli tuta ku nyonga no musindi, oko tuna kuhupula nji kame kuli esibaka no milapelo, mi sebeli twiikala ni kwamba naakati ana ku unganako. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Omukati omunjili mwa onyene ona kutuyupa neli no litina lya Lidiya, ona kutunda mu mulenen̄i no Tiyatila, omuulisi no ibyana no undilu. Woyo olapela Nyambe, mi Ombumu sebeli oyatulula omucima waye nji atokomele eyo aamba Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okukolobeziwa, naasindoo yaye, sebeli otu kumbela nji, “Nji namwaatula nji mbili wa ku sepahala kwa Mbumu, mwiiye mu ndoo yange mwikalemo.” Sebeli otu hapeleza okuta.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Tolongo ku Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Eliywaa linjili kame tuna tanga mu sibaka no milapelo, sebeli tukuwana ni musizana no mubika woyo oli ni mebo no unuhi, naku fumisa onene molyaye mu ku nuha. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Sebeli okon̄a Paulusi naaci yo kuweleza nji, “Alume aa nabika a Nyambe oli beulu! Kame amyambela endila no mooyo!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Eyi kame ana kwitenda mu maywaa no kupula. Kono Paulusi sebeli otina, ni ku futuka ni kwamba ku mebo nji, “Kame ni ku laela mu litina lya Jesu Kilesite otunde mwa yonyene!” Cwale sebeli itunda mwa yonyene ababo ba nako eyeyo.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Kono aolyaye aba ana kumona nji naabwelwe esepo no ku fuma, sebeli alema Paulusi ni Sailasi ni kwatwala mu sibaka no musika balubala nwaa busisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwaalita bouso nwaatuli, sebeli aamba nji, “Alume aa, Majuda mi kame alyanganisa omulenen̄i wetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Kame aiyeta emikwa eyo no kwafanena nji twiikon̄e ni kwiitambula aaci Amaloma.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Enyangela sebeli itateka okwaalwisa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">mi aatuli sebeli akaola eikumango yoo ni kuba etaelo nji afuliwe ni pafa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwafula emiupa no kupula, sebeli aaingenyeka mu tolongo, ni ku laela omutateleli nji aatatelele onene. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Woyo aba na laelelwe ngeeso, sebeli waabeeka mu tolongo na mukaci ni kwaabeeka amakondo oo mu itondo.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Kono ba kaci no usiku Paulusi ni Sailasi sebeli alapela ni kwiimba etindimo kwa Nyambe, mi amapantiti ateeteta. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Mu nako imweya fela sebeli kwiiya ezikinyeho no litunga, cwale emitomo no tolongo sebeli inyanganya mi ababo emyelo sebeli iyatuluka mi amawenge onje sebeli anungutuka ku munu yonje. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Cwale omutateleli aba ana kwinguka ni kumona nji emyelo naiyatuluka, sebeli oshomona omukwale waye nji akwibae, ba kuhupula nji mwendi amapantiti onje naatundumo. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli okuwa ni liywi no kuneneba nji, “Olese okwibaa, kakuli tusilimo toonje.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Omutateleli aba ana ku kumbela elibona, sebeli witukelamo, mu kucila sebeli okakwela ku makondo a Paulusi ni Sailasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Cwale sebeli waatundiseta ba ndee ni kwamba nji, “Alume, ngasibine sani tende nji ni yoyisiwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Cwale sebeli aamba nji, “Olumele mwa Mbumu Jesu, mbuyoyisiwa, wene mane naasindoo yowe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Cwale sebeli aamba amaywi no Mbumu kwa yonyene ni kwao onje ana kwikala mu ndoo yaye. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Sebeli waashimba mu nako eyeyo no usiku, ni kwaayowisa ba miupa-upa yoo, mi sebeli okolobeziwa ababo naasindoo yaye onje. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Cwale sebeli waalita mu ndoo yaye, ni kwaaba eilya balubala woo, ni ku wabelelwa naa sindoo yaya onje kakuli na lumele mwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Kono aba kuna kupa, aatuli sebeli alaela omupolisa, ni kwamba nji, “Waalukulule awo alume akutele.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Cwale omupolisa sebeli osimweta Paulusi amaywi awo, ni kwamba nji, “Aatuli nani tumu nji mu lukululwe mu kutele. Cwalehe na mulukululwa, mi mweende mu kozo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Kame ana tufulu balubala nwaanu, kono kasikutwatula oweli, aci tutendile tuli amaloma, mi naatubeeke mu tolongo. Cwale kame asaela oku tu tundisamo ku mukunda? Kokuulwa! Mwaalesele onyene aiye muku tutundisamo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Amapolisa sebeli asimweta aatuli amaywi ao, mi sebeli acila aba ana kuyupa nji neli Maloma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Cwale sebeli aiya nuuku kokobeza kwaonyene. Sebeli aatundisamo, ni kwakumbela nji asiye omulenen̄i. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Cwale aba ana kutunda mu tolongo, sebeli ata kwa Lidiya, mi cwale aba ana kumana okumona naaasikupumena, ni kwaaongota emicima, mi sebeli afunduka.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Cwale aba ana kubita mu Amfipolisi ni mu Apoloniya, sebeli aiya mu Tesalonika omo kuna kwikala endoo no milapelo no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Paulusi mu mukwa waye sebeli oingena kwa onyene, mi mu tisunda taatu, yo kanana noo okutunda mu man̄olo <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>ni kwataluseta ni kwamonisa nji kame kuna kufanena Kilesite oku yupisiwa okukola ni kwinguka kwaafu, ni kwamba nji, “Woyo Jesu nineeyi mu kwamba kwaanyi eyaye, yokame Kilesite.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Cwale anjili mukaci koo sebeli asusuezwa, nuukuwana ni Paulusi ni Sailasi bamweya naa nokupula no Mangelike mane naakati no kupula ao akutekiwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Kono aendisi no Majuda kame ana kwafelanga omuna, mi sebeli ashimba aafokoli anjili anatoliwa, ni kwaawaneka okwaatenda esitopa, ni kubeeka omulenen̄i mukaci, okutinguluka endoo ya Njasoni, okwaasaela nji aalite kwaanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Cwale aba na kuulwa okwawana, sebeli akokela Njasoni naanjili aasikupumena balubala no abusisi no mulenen̄i alemine okukuwa nji, “Alume awo ana liti outata mu litunga, kame aneyi ni kuno, <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>mi Njasoni naatambula, mi onje kame alwisa emilao ya Sizale aamba nji kame kuli omunjili Ombumu yonyene Jesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Cwale aanu naabusisi no mulenen̄i sebeli ahakanyeha aba ana kuyupa eyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Cwale aba ana kushimba amali kwa Josani ni kwaanjili, sebeli aalesela nuukutela.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Beliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Ababo aasikupumena sebeli afundula Paulusi ni Sailasi ousiku okuta ku Beliya, mi aba ana kukeela sebeli aingena mu ndoo no milapelo no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Cwale aendisi no Majuda aa kame ana kwikala ni micima no kuwaba okubita awo na mu Tesalonika, kakuli kame ana tambula eliywi mu kutukufalelwa, ni kusaisisa mu man̄olo mu liywaa ni liywaa okumona nji einu eyi moikalele. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Ano kupula mwaonyene sebeli apumena, naakati no kukutekeha no Mangelike naalume ngeeso. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Kono cwale aendisi no Majuda na mu Tesalonika aba ana kuyupa nji eliywi lya Nyambe kame lyambiwa kwa Paulusi mu Beliya, sebeli aiya mo mu kufilikanya esicaba. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Cwale aasikupumena ababo sebeli afundula Paulusi, okumutwala ku liwate, kono Sailasi ni Timoteya sebeli asiyalamo. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Awo ana sindeketa Paulusi sebeli akakeela ku Atenesisi, abaana kuuka sebeli aiya ni titaelo okutunda kwa Paulusi nji, Sailasi ni Timoteya ate kwa yonyene muwangu mi ababo sebeli afunduka.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mu Atenesisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Ababo Paulusi yosaatatelele mu Atenesi, sebeli otina aba ana kumona nji omulenen̄i kame wiyalile eifekiso no milimu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Cwale sebeli okanana ni Majuda mu ndoo no milapelo naanu awo acila Nyambe, sebeli otenda ngeso muliywaa ni liywaa ku munu yonje woyo ona kuwaninga mu musika. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Cwale a si Epikulini ni sitoiki filosofi sebeli aambola naye. Mi anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Osibuwabuwi uyu iikene aamba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Kame amonahala kanyi omukutazi no milimu indina.” kakuli kame ana kwaataluseta ya Jesu neyi no kwinguka kwaafu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Cwale sebeli amushimba, okuta naye ku Aleopangasi ni kwamba nji, “Kame tusinga okulimuka eyi tuto no ubya eyi wamba iikene italusa? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Kakuli nuliti eyambo no kwatwaelwa mu matwi etu, cwale kame tusinga okulimuka eyi italusa.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Cwale Amaatenesi onje naanu andina ao ayoyanga mo kaasikutenda esindina konji okwamba simba okuyupa eyi no ubya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli oimana bakaci nwa Aleopangasi ni kwamba nji, “Anyi alume no Atenesi, kame ni lemuhile nji mu ndila yonje kame muli ni tumelo. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Kakuli aba ninabiti kame nina mono outokwa wetu noo ku lapela, sebeli ni wana ealetale aba ku n̄olilwe nji, ‘Kwa Nyambe no kwalimukiwa.’ Iikene cwale aba mu lapelela einu no kwalimukiwa, eyi yanamba kwaanyi. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Nyambe ona ku tenda elitunga niinu yonje ilimo, bakutenda Ombumu no liwilu ni litunga, ka yoyo mu tikeleke ti yakilwe ni maoko nwaanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Simba kame asebelezwa ni maoko nwaanu, kanyi nji kame asaela esinjili, kakuli yonyene kame aba aanu onje ouplo ni kooyela ni inu yonje. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Cwale kame ana kutenda mumweya mu matunga onje nwaanu oku yoya ba lubala no litunga longe, yokame ona lukisa etinako ni miseto no aanu omo ayayo. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Cwale nji kame afanena okusaela Nyambe, mu kuyambuta nji mba mubabatele ni ku muwana, mi yonyene kayoyo oku no kuleba naaci. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>kakuli mwa yonyene kame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Tuyoya, ni kweenda, ni kwikala kwetu.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Sokame anaamba asikuloka anjili nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Naaci kame tuli anaaye luli.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Cwale aba tuli ana a Nyambe, ka tulukele oku yambuta nji Nyambe mba feke kanyi gauda, simba esilibela, simba eliwee, eili eyi imanena esifekiso no mihupulo no munu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Mu nako na kunyima Nyambe kame ana kwaliketanga aanu feela, kono bano kame alaela aanu onje okwaali nji abake. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Kakuli na kubeeka eliywaa elyo saatule elitunga mu niti mu mulume woyo ana kuketa, mi mweesi nabi aanu onje mu kumwingula kwaafu!”<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Cwale aba na kuyupa eyi no kwinguka kwaafu, anjili sebeli asheka kono anjili sebeli aamba nji, “Kame satu kuyupe kame wamba ba tuto eyi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Cwale Paulusi ababo sebeli waasiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Kono aanu anjili sebeli akon̄a ni ku pumena, mwaonyene Denisi no Aleopangasi ni mukati no litina lya Damalisi naanjili aanu.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Mu Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Aba kuna bwi eyo, Paulusi sebeli otunda mu Atenesi okuta ku Kolinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Cwale sebeli okawana Omujuda no litina lya Akila, kakuli Kulaude kame ana ku laela aendisi no Majuda okutunda mu Loma. Cwale sebeli ota okaamona, <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>kakuli neli omunu no musebezi umweya nonyene, sebeli oikala noo, mi kame ana ku sebezanga, kakuli neli asiku tenda amatende. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Cwale kame anakukanananga mu ndoo no milapelo eli no Pumulo lyonje, mi sebeli osusuweza aendisi no Majuda ni Mangelike<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Cwale Sailasi ni Timoteya aba ana kukeela okutunda ku Mesodenia, Paulusi yo patehile ni kukutaza, okuba oupaki ku Majuda nji Kilesite yokame Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Cwale aba ana ku mu sheununa, sebeli otutula eikumango yaye ni kwamba nji, “Ounyinga wenu wikale ba mitwi yenu! Mene sikwite omubonda ku onyene. Okutunda bano kame sanite kwaa simacaba.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Cwale sebeli otundamo ni kuta ku ndoo ya mulume no litina lya Tite Justusi omulapeli wa Nyambe, endoo yaye kame ina kwikalanga abeebi ni ndoo no milapelo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Kilisipo omubusisi no tindoo no milapelo, ona ku pumena mwa Mbumu, bamweya naa sindoo yaye, mi Amakolinte ano kupula ana kuyupa Paulusi sebeli apumena mane niku kolobeziwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Cwale Ombumu sebeli wamba kwa Paulusi mu usiku umweya mu pono nji, “Olese kucila, kono waambe mi olese okondoka, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>kakuli kame nili ni wene, mi kakwisa omunu so kulwisa simba okulemeka, kakuli kame nili naanu no kupula muno mu mulenen̄i.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Cwale sebeli oikala omwaka mu mweya ni tikweti mutanu ni kamweya, (6) yo iyeta eliywi lya Nyambe mwaonyene.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Kono cwale Galiyo yoli omubusisi no Akaya, aendisi no Majuda sebeli akuwana ni ku lwisa Paulusi ni ku mulita balubala no Kuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>Sebeli aamba nji, “Wuyu mulume kame asusuweza aanu ku lapele Nyambe mu ndila eyo ilwisa omulawo!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Kono Paulusi aba ana kusinga okwamba, Galiyo sebeli wambela aendisi no Majuda nji, “Kambe ni mulibaka no kufosa simba okutenda omubonda, kambe kame kuli elibaka elyo ni twesa oku miyupisisa anyi aendisi no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Kono kakuli ni mulibaka no tipuzo no maywi ni matina ni mulawo wetu, mu kumonene mwenyene. Kame ni kana okwatula eyambo eyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Cwale sebeli waatundisa mu Kuta. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Cwale onje sebeli alema Sosiene, omwendisi no ndoo no milapelo ni ku mufula balubala no Kuta. Kono Galiyo kasi kutwalako omucima.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuuka ku Antiyoki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Munyima no eyi, Paulusi sebeli oikala amaywaa no kupula, ni kusiya akwaye ni kulutela ku Siliya, yo enda ni Pulisila ni Akila. Ku Senkiliya, sebeli okukuliwa etin̄uki, kakuli kame ano kununga esinjili. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Cwale sebeli akeela mu Efese, mi sebeli waasiyamo, kono yonyene sebeli ota mu ndoo no milapelo mu ku kanana ni Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Cwale aba ana ku mukumbela nji aikale noo enako no kuleba, sebeli okana. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Kono aba kwaasiya, sebeli waambela nji, “Kame sani kauke kwaaci nji Nyambe mba singi.” Cwale sebeli oluta okusiya Efese.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela mu Sesaaliya, sebeli ota okakeeta etikeleke mi cwale sebeli oshetumuka ku Antiyoki. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Munyima no kwikalamo enako, sebeli ota ku sibaka ni sibaka mu naha yonje no Galatiya ni Filigiya yo ongota aiyetwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apolosi mu Efese ni mu Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Cwale Omujuda onakwisaniwa nji Apolosi, woyo ona kuleyelwa mu Alekizandiliya, sebeli wiiya mu Efese. Neli omulume no kulimuka okwamba wino ona kwiyeta eliywi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Kame ana kwiyeta mu ndila ya Mbumu, ni kutenda omubika mu mebo, kame aamba ni kwiyeta wino-wino einu eyi yaama Jesu, kono eyo ana kulimuka yonyene neli kolobezo ya Jowani fela. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Sebeli otateka okwamba mu undume mu ndoo no milapelo, kono cwale Pulisila ni Akila aba ana ku muyupa, sebeli amutwala ku ndoo ni ku mutaluseta omo aikalele Nyambe wino. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Cwale aba ana kusinga okuta okulutela ku Akaya, aasikupumena sebeli amususuweza ni kun̄olela aiyetwa nji amutambule. Aba ana kukeela, sebeli otusa onene mu sishemo awo ana ku pumena. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Kakuli kame ana kutwesa okwambela aendisi no Majuda mu maata no kuneneba mukwamonisa mu man̄olo nji, Kilesite yokame Jesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi mu Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Apolosi yoli mu Kolinte Paulusi sebeli okaula enaha eyi ilumbile ni kwiiya mu Efese. Omo sebeli owana aiyetwa anjili. <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Cwale sebeli waaibanguta nji, “Na mukutambula Emebo No Kukena aba muna ku pumena?” Mi sebeli atambula nji, “Kokuulwa, katwa siku yupa simba mbicana nji kame kuli Emebo No Kukena.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Cwale sebeli waaibanguta nji, “Ka kolobezo mu na kukolobezwa nayo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Sebeli atambula nji, “Mu kolobezo ya Jowani.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli wamba nji, “Jowani kame ana ku kolobeza ni kolobezo no kubaka, okwambela aanu nji apumene kwa woyo soiya munyima yaye, yonyene Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Aba ana kuyupa eyo, sebeli akolobezwa mu litina lya Mbumu Jesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Cwale Paulusi aba anakumana okwabeeka amaoko aye beulu, Emebo No Kukena sebeli yaashulumukela beulu yoo, mi sebeli aamba mu tindimi no kwalimukiwa mane ni kunuha. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Oonje kame ana kukwana epalo ikuma ba likumi naayili (12).<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Cwale sebeli oingena mu ndoo no milapelo mi mu tikweti taatu yo aamba mu undume, yo kanana noo ni kwakolwisa eyi no mubuso wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Kono anjili kame ana kwikala ni mahanyi okwapumena, aamba eyi no kwiiba eyi no Ndila balubala no mukopano, sebeli otunda kwa onyene, ni ku shimba aiyetwa, yo ambola noo mu liywaa ni liywaa mu muyako no ndoo ya Tilanasi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Eyo sebeli yekeza mu myaka yiili, nji cwale aanu no Asiya ayupe eliywi lya Mbumu aendisi no Majuda bamweya ni Magelike<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aana a Sikeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Cwale Nyambe naku tenda etimakazo no ku komokisa mu maoko a Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Etitaulo mane ni tinyambi naiku tundisiwa ba lutu lyaye sebeli ibeekiwa kwaa sikukola, ni meeti sebeli atunda, ni mebo no kwiiba sebeli itunda mwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Cwale anjili no aendisi no Majuda ana kwendanga atundisa Emebo no kwiiba, kame ano kutusisanga okwamba elitina lya Jesu nji, “Kame ni ku laela mu litina lya Jesu, woyo ona kukutaziwa kwa Paulusi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Aana mutanu na yiili no mupulisita mukulu no Majuda no litina lya Sikeba ana kutenda ngeso.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Kono emebo no kwiiba sebeli yaatambula nji, “Jesu ni muyii, ni Paulusi ni muyii, kono wene tiwe anyine?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Cwale omulume woyo ona kwingeniwa ku mebo kwiiba sebeli waamatukela beulu ni kwaakoma, mane sebeli atunda ku ndoo eyo aali njeshe ni ku lemekiwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Cwale eyi yonje sebeli ilimukiwa kwaanu onje na mu Efese, aendisi no Majuda bamweya ni Magelike, mi sebeli aingenenwa okucila onje, mi elitina lya Mbumu Jesu sebeli lilumbiwa onene. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Aasikupumena no kupula kwaao ana kupumena sebeli aiya, mu kuukunyaza ni shongotola eyo no kwiiba ana kutendanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Cwale epalo nwao ana kutendanga amabibo sebeli alita etibuka too ni kuticin̄a aanu onje amwine, mi sebeli abala eteko no tibuka kame ina kwana eikiti makumi mutanu (50; 000) no muwaya-waya no silibela. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Cwale eliywi lya Mbumu sebeli liyanduluka ngeso ni kukula.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emifilifili mu Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Cwale eyo aba ina kubwako, Paulusi sebeli olela mu muhupulo no mebo nji abite mu Mesodeniya ni Akaya ni kuta ku Jelusalema, yo aamba nji, “Munyima no kwikala kuya,” sebeli wamba nji, “Kame ni fanena okamona ku Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Cwale aba ana kumana otuma aiyetwa aye ayili mu Mesodoniya awo amutusa, Timoteya ni Elasito, yonyene yosili mu Asiya mbicani.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Kusili mu nako eyo omufilifili no kuneneba sebeli wiiya mulibaka no Ndila. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Kakuli omulume wisaniwa Demetiliusi, woyo ona kuumbanga endoo no silibela no milimu no Atemisi, kame ana kuluwisa onene abeleki no musebezi owo. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Cwale sebeli waawaneka bamweya, naawo anjili asebeza omusebezi kanyi woo, ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Alume, kame mulimukile nji aba mufuma ni mulibaka no musebezi ou. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Cwale kame mu mona ni kuyupa nji kasa mu Efese feela kono ni mu naha yonje no Asia Paulusi kame ana susuweze ni kukolwisa epalo no aanu, yo aamba nji, emilimu itendiwa ni maoko kasa emilimu. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Ekozi eyo iiya, kasa nji omusebezi wetu mbau shwauka, kono ngeso ni ndoo no mulimu mukati otompeha oisniwa nji Atemisi kame saya liketwe kanyi esinu na mbulwa tuso, nji mane niku tompeha kwaye kame saku sinyehe, yonyene woyo olapelelwa mu Asiya ni mu litunga lyonje!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa eyo, sebeli atina onene ni kukuwa nji, “Woyo no kuneneba ni Aetemisi no Maifese!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Cwale omulenen̄i sebeli wiyala ni ku hakanyeha, mi sebeli aitukela bamweya mu teatele nikulema Gayusi ni Alisitako aanu na mu Mesodoniya awo ana ku sindeketanga Paulusi mu misipili. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Paulusi kame ana kusinganga oku monahaza kwaanu no kupula, kono aasikupumena kasi ku mulumelelanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Cwale ni manduna anjili na mu Esiya awo anokusinga naye, sebeli amutumena ni ku mukumbela nji alese okumonahaza ba patelo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Cwale anjili sebeli akuwa sinu simweya, anjili sinjili kame, kakuli kame ana kuungana mu kuhakanyeha, mi ano kupula kasiku limuka eso ana kuunganena. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Anjili aanu mu nyangela sebeli atundisa Alekizanda, woyo aendisi no Majuda ana kubeeka kuuso. Cwale Alekizanda sebeli okobeta ni Lyoko nji akutambwele kwaanu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Kono aba ana ku lemuha nji neli Mujuda, mu tihola timbili sebeli akuwa onje mu liywi limweya nji, “Ounene ni wa Atemisi no Maifese!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Cwale omun̄oli no Kuta no mulenen̄i sebeli ondota enyangela ni kwamba nji, “Aana no Efese!” anyine kwaanu no kwalimuka nji omulenen̄i no Efese omubabaleli no ndoo no mulimu no mukati no kutompeha Atemisi ni wa liwee no sitabelo no kukena sinakwi ku wilu? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Cwale mumone nji einu eyo kailatulwa, abakulingeso kame mulukela okondoka mi mulese okutenda esinjili mu wangu. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Kakuli kame munaliti aa alume bano nji kasi sinya endoo no mulimu wetu no mukati simba nji asikunyefula emilimu yetu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Cwale nji Demetiliyasi naabeleki ali kwa yonyene nji kame ali ni muzeko ni munu, etikuta kame tiyatulukile, kame kuli nasi kwatula, akutwale ku kuzeka. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Kono nji kame kuli ni taba indina musaela, kame saiatulwe mu mukopano ofanena. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Kakuli kame tuli mu utata no ku atulwa mu mufilifili balelo, kakuli katu kwite elibaka satwimane nalyo mulibakano mukopano owo. <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba eyo, sebeli olukulula omukopano.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Ku Masedoniya ni mu Gelike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Cwale omufilifili aba una kubwa, Paulusi sebeli owaneka aiyetwa, okwaasusueza ni kwaalana, niku funduka okuta ku Mesodoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okumona enaha eyo, ni kwaasusuweza onene, sebeli ota mu naha no Magelike <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Omo sebeli okaikalamo etikweti taatu, mi aendisi no Majuda sebeli amukundamena abo anokutukiseta okuta mu Siliya, sebeli onahana okuuka endila no Mesodoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Sopatele naku Beliya omwana Pilasi sebeli oomu sindeketa, Alisitakasi ni Sekundasi Amatesalonika, ni Gayusi na ku Debe ni Timoteya, naa naku Asiya neli Tikikasi ni Tilofimasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Onyene kame anoku tangeta, sebeli aka twimanena mu Tulowasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Kono aci sebeli tu tunda mu Filipi munyima no mukiti no Inkwa no mbulwa omumena, munyima no amaywaa mutanu, sebeli tu keela mu Tulowasi, omo sebeli twiikalamo amaywaa mutanu naayiili (7).<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aba ana Kupota aka no Mamaneneno ku Tulowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Ba liywaa no weli mu sunda, abo me tukuwanine bamweya okulya esilyela, Paulusi sebeli wamba noo, kakuli kame na kufanena okufunduka amasiku eliywaa linaku tatamako, mi kame ana kwambola noo enako no kuleba mane konji bakaci no usiku. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Kame kuna kwikala etilambi no kupula mu ndoo na kuwilu omo tu nakukuwanena. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Cwale ondumbana no litina lya Eutikasi kame ana kwikala mu lihaulo no ndoo, sebeli olangana otulo no kuneneba luli abo Paulusi yo twalelela okwambola ba nako no kuleba, yoli mu tulo, sebeli okwela banji okatunda ku ndoo na kuwilu no waatu. Sebeli ononiwa yo file. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli oshetumukela banji ni kwinamena beulu yaye, ni ku mufumbatela yo aamba nji, “Olese kubilaela, kakuli omoyo waye osili mwa yonyene.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Cwale Paulusi aba ana kukambama kame, sebeli okomauna esinkwa, aba ana kumana okulya, sebeli wambola noo enako no kuleba konji amasiku, sebeli ofunduka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ondumbana sebeli amutwala ku mundi yo yoya, mi sebeliaombaombiwa mu micima onene luli.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okutunda mu Tulowasi okuta mu Miletasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Kono sebeli tuku tangeta ku sisepe, sebeli tukulongamo ni ku fuula okuta ku Asosi, omo kame tunaku singa okushimba Paulusi, yonyene kame ana kukutukiseta ngeso, kakuli yonyene kame ana kusaela okweenda ni makondo. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Cwale aba ana ku tuwana ku Asosi, sebeli tu mu longa, ni kuta naye ku Mitileni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Aba tuna kufuulamo, eliywaa lina kutatamako sebeli tukeela ba mabapa ni Kiyosi, eli lina kutatamako kame sebeli tukakeela ku Samosi, elinjili kame eliywaa sebeli tukakeela ku Miletasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Kakuli Paulusi kame ana kulela nji alese okufuweka mu Efese, nji cwale alese oku liyehela mu Esiya kakuli kame ano ku tukiseta okaikala mu Jelusalema nji kame kutwesahala, ba liywaa no Pentakota.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okulana kwa Paulusi Kwaakulu no Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Paulusi yoli mu Miletasi, sebeli otumena ku Efese okaisana aakulu no keleke. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela kwa yonyene, sebeli waambela nji, “Kame mulimukile omukwa nina yoyo mukaci kenu enako yonje okutunda ba liywaa no weli elyo nina kukeela mu Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Kame nina sebeleze Mbumu mu uku kokobeza konje ni mu myooti ni mu miliko ina kuniyela mu mifumbo no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Omo ka nisi ukela munyima oku myambela esinu sonje eso sina ku fanena oku mitusa, ni ku miiyeta mu sicaba ni mu ndoo ni ndoo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Menilemine okupakela aendisi no Majuda bamweya ni Mangelike kweeyi no kubaka kwa Nyambe neyi no tumelo mwa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Komumone cwale, kame nita ku Jelusalema, meni nungilwe mu mebo, mu kwalimuka eyo saika tendahaleko kwa mene. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Esi ni limukile ninji mu mulenen̄i ni mulenen̄i Emebo No Kukena kame ina kuni pakela nji okunungiwa ni ku yandisiwa kame initatelele. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Kono kani bilaele eyo, mi kanibalele omoyo wange nji niwautokwa kwa mene, esi nisinga feela ninji ni manenene omusipili ni musebezi wange ananibi Ombumu Jesu, no kupaka eliywaa no sishemo sa Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>Cwale komumone, kame ni limukile nji aanyi monje awo inendele emisipili okumikutaza eyi no mubuso wa Nyambe kamutamba okumona olubala lwange kame. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Cwalehe kame ni myambela eniti balelo nji, kani kwite omubonda no unyinga wenu moonje. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Kakuli kani siuka munyima mu kumitaluseta omulelo wonje wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Cwale aanyi muku babalele, mi mu lise omutapi mu nabiwi oku ubabalela mu Mebo No Kukena oku babalela Endoo ya Nyambe ya Nyambe eyo ana kuulele ni unyinga wa Mwanaye. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Kakuli kame ni limukile nji aba sani misiye, kame sakwiiye aandiwi no kucilisa mukaci kenu, awo saulwe okuyupela omutapi amakeke. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Cwale mukaci kenu luli kame sakutunde alume asaambe einu no mapwa nji aiyetwa aakon̄e. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Cwalehe mutokomele, muhupule nji mu myaka yaatu kani lesele okweleza ni myooti ousiku ni munji ku munu ni munu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>Cwalehe bano kame ni mibeeka kwa Nyambe ni ku liywi no sishemo saye, elyo saali miyake ni kumiba esanda naa akenine onje. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Kanisi lakaza esilibela ni gauda ya munu simba esibyana. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Aanyi mwenyine kame muyii omo ina belekele ni maoko ange okuwana omu no kuyoyela mane nawo ana kwikalanga nange. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Mu inu yonje kame nina mi monisa nji mu sebeze ngeso, kame mu fanena okutusa asiku fokola, me muhupula amaywi ana kwamba Jesu nji, ‘Embuyoti kame ili onene mu kuba kasa muku tambula.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba ngeso, sebeli okubama ni manwi banji ni kulapela noo onje. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Cwale onje sebeli alila niku kwela mu mbando ya Paulusi ni kumutubeta. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Kame ana kutomoha onene emicima onje mulibaka no maywi aye ana kwamba nji kaatamba kumona kame olubala lwaye. Cwale sebeli amusindeketa okamukeeta ku sisepe.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Yoota ku Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Cwale aba tuna mana oukutaba noo mu ku bambaba feela, sebeli tufuula, mi sebeli tulumba ku Kosi, mi liywaa linakutatamako sebeli tukeela mu Lodesi, okutunda omo sebeli tuta ku Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Cwale aba tuna kuwana esisepe silumbile ku Foenisiya, sebeli tukulongamo ni kuta. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Cwale aba tuna keela mu sibaka no Sipulasi, sebeli tusi yupela ku simoo okuta mu Silia, sebeli tuka fuweka mu Tile, kakuli omo esisepe kame sina kulongola etutu. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Cwale sebeli tuwanamo aiyetwa, ni kwiikala noo amaywaa mutanu ni twiili (7). Mu mebo sebeli aambela Paulusi nji alese okuta ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Cwale amaywaa etu aba ana kubwa, sebeli tu funduka okwekeza omusipili wetu ni kutu sindeketa onje, naa moyo oo naanoo, ni ku tulita konji aba ana kutu siisa omulenen̄i, sebeli tu kubama ni manwi ba likamba okulapela ni ku kulana omnjili ni munjili okuwaba. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Cwale sebeli tukulonga mu sisepe, onyene sebeli aukela ku mundi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Cwale aba tuna kumana omusipil wetu okutunda mu Tile, sebeli tuta ku Tolemaisi ni kukeeta aasikupumena ni kwiikala noo eliywaa limweya. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Eliywaa lina ku tatamako sebeli tu funduka nuukakeela mu Sesaaliya, mi sebeli twiingena mu ndoo ya Filipi omwaambi no mikopano, woyo ona kutenda omunjili noao mutanu ni twiili (7) ni kwikala kwa yonyene. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Kame ana kwikala naanaye anee nwa sizana no kwaakwaliwa, ana ku nuhanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Aba tuna kwikalamo amaywaa mbicana, sebeli kwiiya omunuhi no litina lya Agabusi ona ku tunda ku Judeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela kwaaci, sebeli okununga olukanda lwa Paulusi ku maoko ni ku makondoo ni kwamba nji, “Eesi, so kame esinaambiwa ku Mebo No Kukena nji, aendisi no Majuda mu Jelusalema mwasanungele omunya lukanda olu, ni ku mubeeka mu maata ano macaba.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Cwale aba tuna kuyupa ngeso, aaci naanu sebeli tu mukumbela nji alese okukambama okuta ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli otambula nji, “Iikene aba mulila ni kucola omucima wange? Kakuli mene kame ni kutukisite kasa okwingena mu tolongo feela, kono simba okufa ku Jelusalema mulibaka no litina lya Mbumu Jesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Sebeli okana okukolwisiwa kwaaci, sebeli toondoka ni kwamba nji, “Ku tendahale eso sisingwa kwa Mbumu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Munyima no maywaa ao, sebeli tuku tukiseta okuta ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Cwale naiyetwa anjili ana ku tunda ku Sesaaliya sebeli ata naaci, oku tutwala ku ndoo ya Nasoni, omwiyetwa no kale na ku Sipulasi, oko tuna ku fanena okwikala.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Potela Jakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Cwale aba tuna ku keela mu Jelusalema, aasikupumena sebeli atu tambula wino mu ku wabelelwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Eliywaa lina ku tatamako Paulusi ota naaci kwa Jakobo, mi onje akulu sebeli aikalako. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Munyima no kwakeeta, sebeli otalusa wino einu eyo Nyambe ana tende kwaasimacaba mu musebezi waye. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa eyo, sebeli akanyisa Nyambe. Mi sebeli aamba kwa yonyene nji, “Omwabetu, esi omwine nji, aendisi no Majuda aa ana lumele sebeli eikiti no kupula, mi aanu onje kame atukufalelwe omulawo. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Kame anaambelwe eyowe nji wene kame wiyeta aendisi no Majuda onje awo ayoya mwano asimacaba nji afulalele Mushe, okwaambela nji alese okutwala anoo ku mupato simba okukuteka eizo yoo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Cwale ngasibine saitendahale? Kame saayupe nji nwiyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Otenda eyo tukwambela. Kame tukwite alume anee awo ali munji no sepiso noutokwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Waashimbe aa alume okakukenise noo, mi waatenekele nji cwale aka beulise emitwi yoo. Cwale aanu onje kame saalimuke nji kakwisa esinjili eso ana yupu kweyo inambiwa mulibaka lyowe kono nji ni wene kame oyoya mu ku tokomela omulawo wa Mushe. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Kono kweeyo no asimacaba ana lumele, kame tunaatumene elin̄olo no mulelo wetu nji kame afanena okukana kweeyo ina tendelwe emilimi, ni ku unyinga, ni kweyo ina owiwa, ni uhule.<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli oshimba aalume awo, mi ba liywaa linaku tatamako sebeli okukenisa noo ni kwingena mu ndoo ya Nyambe, okwamba amaywaa no kukenisa koo aba saiyatetetwe ni nubu nai kubiwa eyi no munu ni munu woo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okunungiwa Kwa Paulusi mu Ndoo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Cwale amaywaa mutanu naayili aba ana kwatumela okubwa, aendisi no Majuda na ku Esiya awo ana kumumona mu ndoo ya Nyambe, sebeli asusuweza enyangela ina kukuwana mu kupula, ni ku mulema. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Cwale sebeli akuwa nji, “Alume no Isilaele, komutuse! Uno yokame omutu ona kwiiyetanga aanu onje mu ibaka yonje okulwisa aanu ni mulawo ni sibaka sino, abakulingeso osilita kame Amagelike mu ndoo ya Nyambe, mi na silafaza esibaka sino no kukena. <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Kakuli kame ana kumumona oweli yo enda ni Tolofimo Omwiifese mu mulenen̄i, mi sebeli anahana nji Paulusi mwendi namu liti mu ndoo ya Nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Cwale omulenen̄i onje sebeli oimana amaefe-efe, mi aanu sebeli aituka ba bamweya, okalema Paulusi ni ku mukoka okumutundisa mu ndoo ya Nyambe mi ababo emyelo sebeli iyatiliwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Cwale aba ana kweteka nji amwibaye, eliywi sebeli liiya ku mwendisi no masole no Maloma nji Jelusalema yonje naimana ni mufilifili. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Mu nako imweya sebeli oshimba amasole na shebuluki oo, ni kwiitukela kwa onyene, cwale aba anakumona omwendisi ni masole, sebeli alesela okumufula. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Cwale omwendisi sebeli osheteta ni kulema Paulusi, ni ku laela nji anungiwe ni mawenge ayili. okubinda aibangute eyaye, nji yokame anyine, neeyo ana tende. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Anjili mu nyangela sebeli akuweleza sinu simweya, anjili sindina, mi sebeli okwangwa okulimukabo eniti mulibaka no lilata, sebeli nji Paulusi atwaliwe mu ndoo no kongola. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Cwale aba ana kukeela ba matulameno, konji oku shimbiwa ku Masole mulibaka no kutweba no nyangela. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Kakuli okupula nwaanu kame ana ku mukon̄anga, akuweleza nji, “Aibaiwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Yoku Sileleza Yonyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Paulusi yoli beebi ni kwingenyekwa mu ndoo no kongola, sebeli wamba ku mwendisi no masole nji, “Kame ni kumbela okwamba nowe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Woyo sebeli omwibanguta nji, “Kame olimukile okwamba Esigelike?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Kana kasa wene Omwengepita, uya, ona liti omufilifili mu maywaa aya anabu ni kwetelela aibai alume ana ku kwana eikiti inee (4;000) okuta noo mu lihalaupa?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Paulusi sebeli otambula nji, “Mene kame nili Omujuda, okutundelela ku Tasusi mu Silisia, omulenen̄i noutokwa, Kame ni kumbela kwa wene nji naambe kwaanu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Cwale aba ana ku mulumelela, sebeli oimana aba noku tinena, mi sebeli okobeta aanu ni Lyoko, cwale aba kuna kondoka onene tuu, sebeli wamba noo mu puo no Sihebelu nji,<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>“Abaange naa sitange, muyupe aba ni kutambwela balubala wenu!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Cwale aba ana kuyupa nji kame aambela mu puo no Mahehelu sebeli aondoka onene luli, mi sebeli wamba nji, <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>“Kame nili Omujuda, ona leyeliwa ku Tasusi mu Silisiya, kono kame nina kulele omuno mu mulenen̄i ku makondo a Gamaliele, mi kame nina iyetiwa no kupetahala okuta mu mukwa nwaa njekulyetu, ni kutukufalelwa eyi no Nyambe, kanyi omo mwiikalele balelo naanyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Kame nina lwisi onene Endila eyo mane oku twala ku lifu, kame nina kununganga alume bamweya naakati okwaa ingenyeka mu tolongo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Omupulisita mukulu ni kuta no akulu onje kame ani paka. kame nina ku shimba aman̄olo okutunda kwaa onyene okutwala kwaabange, mi sebeli ni funduka okuta ku Damaseka nuukashimbamo aawo ana kwikalangamo ni kwaalita mu tololongo mu Jelusalema nji abiwe ekoto.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Yoamba Einokufuktuka kwaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>“Cwale abo meni lemine okweenda nji nishetete kunyonga ni Damaseka, omunji ba 12 okolokoluli olumonyi no kuneneba luna kutuda ku wilu ababo sebeli lunifuka. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Cwale sebeli nikwela banji ni kuyupa eliywi lyaamba kwa mene nji, ‘Suaule, Saule! Iikene oni yandiseta?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Sebeli ni tambula nji, ‘Tiwe anyine, Mbumu?’ Cwale sebeli oni tambula nji, ‘Time Jesu no Nazaleta, woyo o yandisa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Cwale awo nina kwikala noo kame ana kumona olumonyi kono kasi kuyupa eliywi lya woyo ona kwamba kwa mene. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Cwale sebeli naamba nji, ‘Iikene nifanena okutenda, Mbumu?’ Mi Ombumu sebeli onambela nji, ‘Oimane, mi ote mu Damaseka, cwale omo kame soka ambelwe yonje eyo ofanena okutenda.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Kakuli cwale kanisiku mona mulibakano kanya no lumonyi olo, kame nina kulemiwa ku Lyoko kwaao nina kweenda nooo okwingena mu Damaseka.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>“Ananiasi, omulume onaku kubeeka kwa Nyambe okuta mu mukwa no mulawo, woyo opakwa kwaanu onje awo ayoyamo. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Cwale sebeli oiya kwa mene, ni kwiimana kunyonga yange, ni kwamba nji, ‘Saule minange, obiwe okumona kame!’ Mi mu nako eyeyo, sebeli ni mona ni ku mwaliketa. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Cwale ni kwamba nji, Nyambe nwaa njekulyetu nakukete nji olimuke eso asaela, okumona woyo no kuluka ni kuyupa ku liywi litunda mu kanwa kaye. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Kakuli kame sotende opaki waye kwaanu onje kweeyo ona mono ni kuyupa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Cwale bano siikene osi tatelele? Oimane mi okolobezwe, mi oyowisiwe ku ibi yowe, wisane ba litina lyaye.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwiisanwa kwa Paulusi oka Kutaza Kwaasimacaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>“Aba nina kumana okuukela ku Jelusalema ababo meni lapela mu ndoo ya Nyambe, sebeli ni mona epono, <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>ni ku mona Ombumu yo aamba kwa mene nji, ‘Olelube mi muwangu otunde mu Jelusalema, kakuli katamba ku tambula oupaki so ni pake.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Cwale sebeli ni tambula nji, ‘Kame alimukile nji time nina kwiingenyekanga mu tolongo mu ndoo ni ndoo no milapelo ni kufulanga awo ana kupumenanga kwa wene. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Cwale ababo ounyinga wa Setefani opaki wowe aba ona kwiiteka, kame nina kwikalako, ni kupumena okwiibaiwa kwaye, ni kubabalela eikumango ya awo ana ku mwiibaa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Cwale sebeli wamba kwa mene nji, ‘Ote, kakuli kame sani kutume oku no kuleba kwaasimacaba.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Omuloma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Sebeli amuteeteta okutwala abo ana kwambela eliywi elyo, ababo sebeli atangisa okukuwa ni liywi lili beulu nji, “Omunu nongeso mu mutundise mu litunga, kafanene okuyoya!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Sebeli akuwa ni kututula eikumango yoo ni ku tunyisa eliluli mu wilu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Omwendisi no masole sebeli olaela nji alitiwe mu ndoo no kongola, nji aka mwibangute yo fuliwa nji alimuke eso amukuwela. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Kono aba ana kumana okumununga ni mihala no itumba, Paulusi sebeli oibanguta omwendisi ona kwimananga ba nyonga nji, “Kana nitukelo okufula omunu no Muloma, yo kasi atuliwa kale?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Cwale onduna aba ana kuyupa ngeso, sebeli ota ku mweendisi no masole ni kwamba kwa onyene nji, “Siikene eso osinga okutenda? Kakuli omunu uyu ni Muloma!” <verse eid="ACT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Cwale omwendisi no masole sebeli wiiya kwa Paulusi ni kumwibanguta nji, “Onambele, niti luli kame oleilwe ku Maloma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulusi sebeli otambula nji, “Ee.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Omwendisi no masole sebeli otambula nji, “Kame nina teneke amali no kupula nji nu kuulele etukelo eyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulusi sebeli otambula nji, “Kono mene ni mu kuleiwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Cwale awo ana ku singa oku mufula sebeli amusiya ababo, omwendisi no masole ni yonyene sebeli ocila aba ana kuyupa nji Muloma, kakuli kame ana ku mununga.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yooli booso no Kuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Kono eliywaa aba lina kupa, mu kusinga oku limuka elibaka no niti eyo amuzekiseta aendisi no Majuda, omwendisi no masole sebeli onungutula Paulusi, ni ku laelela apulisita akulu naa sikuta onje nji akuwane, sebeli ota ni Paulusi ni ku mubeeka balubala woo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Paulusi yo alikete onene asi Kuta no Majuda sebeli wamba nji, “Abaange, kame ninaende ni lizwalo no kuwaba koonje balubala wa Nyambe, okulita ba liywaa no balelo lino.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Cwale Ananiyasi omupulisita mukulu sebeli olaela awo ana kwimananga kunyonga yaye nji amupobole ba kanwa, <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Nyambe mba ku pobola, wene elimota libasizwe elikena! Kandi aba oikalile bano ni ku naatula okuta mu mulawo, kandi aba olaela nji nipoboliwe, kame ocola omulawo!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Awo ana kwimananga ku nyonga yaye, sebeli aamba nji, “Weene kame okuta omupulisita mukulu wa Nyambe?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Paulusi sebeli otambula nji, “Abaange, kanisi limuka nji mupulisita mukulu kakuli kame ku n̄olilwe nji, ‘Olese okwamba eyi no kwiiba ku mwendisi no aanu owe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Cwale Paulusi mu kulimuka nji anjili neli Asaduki mi anjili neli Afalisi, sebeli okuwa mu Kuta nji, “Abaange, mene kame nili omufalisi, o mwana no mufalisi, kame naatulwa mulibakano kwinguka nwaafu kame nili mu muliko!” <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba eyo, omufilifili sebeli winguka mukaci no Afalisi naa Saduki, mi esikwata sebeli sikutaba bakaci. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Kakuli Asaduki kame aamba nji kakwisa okwinguka kwaafu, simba elin̄eloi, simba Emebo, kono Afalisi kame apumena eyo yonje. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Cwale sebeli kwinguka elilata no kuneneba luli, mi anjili aiyeti no mualao aa aimanena Afalisi, sebeli aimana ni kwamba nji, “Ka tusiwana esi sifosahalile kwa yonyene uyu mulume! Mwendi ni mebo simba elin̄eloi yaamba mwa yonyene!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Cwale Omufilifii aba onaku ekezeha, omwendisi no masole sebeli ocila nji Paulusi mba kaolwa mu ibindi kwa onyene, ni ku laela amasole okushetumuka okashimba Paulusi mukaci koo ni ku mulita mu ndoo no kongola.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Ousiku ona kutatamako Ombumu sebeli oimana kunyonga yaye ni kwamba nji, “Olese kucila, kakuli kanyi aba ona paka eyange mu Jelusalema, cwale ni mu Loma kame ofanena okanipaka ngeso.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulelo no Kwibaa Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kupa, Amjuda anjili sebeli akuwana okulela ni kweeta nji katamba kulya simba okunwa konji aba saibae Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Awo ana ku tenda omulelo owo, neli aanu ana kubitelela makumi anee. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Cwale sebeli ata kwa mupulisita omukulu ni kwaakulu, ni kwamba nji, “Kame tuna kunungu oluci nji ka tutamba kulya esinjili konji aba satwiibae Paulusi oweli. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Abakulingeso, anyi naasi Kuta mu simwete omwendisi no masole amulite kwaanyi, mi munise kanyi kame musinga okusaisisa etitaba taye. “Cwale aci kame tukutukisite oku mwibaa yo kasikeela kale kwaanyi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Kono omwana mandaye Paulusi no mushimani aba ana kuyupa emifumbo yoo, sebeli ota mu ndoo no kongola okasimweta Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli oisana omunjili no abaleki ni kwamba nji, “Otwale uyu ndumbana ku mwendisi no masole, kakuli kame ali nesi asaela okumwambela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Cwale sebeli omushimba ni kumutwala ku mwendisi no masole ni kwamba nji, “Paulusi omupantiti kame anani isana ni kuni kumbela nji nilite uyu ndumbana kwa wene, kakuli kame kuli eso asaela okwamba kwa wene.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Omwendisi no masole sebeli omulema ku Lyoko, ni kuta naye ku nyonga ni ku mwibanguta nji, “Siikene eso osaela oku naambela?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “aendisi no Majuda kame ana kuyupu nji aku kumbele nji byuunda waalitele Paulusi ku Kuta yoo, atende kanyi kame asaele okusaisisa etaba yaye. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Kono olese okwaa lumelela, kakuli alume no kubitelela amakumi anee awo ana mukundamene, kame akunungile oluci nji katamba okulya simba oku nwa esinjili koonji aba sa ibae Paulusi oweli. Cwale kame aku tukisite, ni kutatelela esepiso okutunda kwa wene.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Cwale omwendisi no masole sebeli ousa ondumbana, ni ku mulaela nji, “Olese okwambela omunu nji nunambele etaba eyi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo tumiwa kwa Mubusisi Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Cwale sebeli oisana aendisi ayiili no masole ni kwamba nji, “Ba nako no 9 okoloko (21) ousiku mu kutukisete mu shimbe amasole akwana emyanda yiili (200) ni timbii makumi mutanu naayili, (70) naalume akwana emyanda yiili (200) asikulwisa etimbi nji ate ku Sesaaliya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Mulukise ni tipeleswa eto sa titiniwe kwa Paulusi, mi mumutwale wino kwa Felikisi omubusisi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Cwale sebeli on̄ola elin̄olo eli lyaamba nji,<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>“Mene Kilaudiyasi Lisiyasi kwa Felikisi, omubusisi okutekiwa onene, mulumele. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Omunu woyo kame ana kulemiwa ku Majuda, mi kame ana ku singa oku mwibaa, cwale mukuyupa nji ni muloma sebeli niiya ni masole oku muyoyisa. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Cwale mu kusinga nji ni limuke eyo amulwiseta, sebeli ni mutwala ku Kuta yoo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Omo sebeli ni wana nji kame amu zekisa mu yambo no mulawo woo, kono kakwisa omubonda owo ofanena elifu simba okunungiwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Cwale aba nina kumana okuyupa nji munu woyo kame ana kundamenwa, ababo sebeli ni mutumena kwa wene, mi kame nina laelele awo amuzekisa nji eyo amuzekiseta ailite kwa wene .”<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Cwale amasole, sebeli atenda omo ana laelelwe, okushimba Paulusi ni kumulita ousiku ku Antipatilisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kupa sebeli aukela ku ndoo no kongola, okusiya asikutina etimbii aata ni Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Cwale aba anaku keela mu Sesaaliya, sebeli aba omubusisi elin̄olo, mane niku lita Paulusi kwa yonyene. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Omubusisi aba ana kumana okubala elin̄olo, sebeli oibanguta Paulusi nji kame atunda ku tolopo ibine. Cwale aba ana kuyupa nji kame atunda mu Silisiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>sebeli wamba nji, “Kame sani yupe eyowe aba sakeele awo akuzekisa.” Cwale sebeli olaela nji atatelelwe mu ndoo ya Heloda.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Zekisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Munyima no maywaa mutanu omupulisita mukulu Ananiyasi sebeli oiya nakulu anjili nimutalusi wisanwa Tetulusi. Mi sebeli akumonahaza kwa mubusisi oku talusa eyi ya Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Cwale aba ana ku mwiisana, Tetulusi sebeli otangisa oku muhapeleza okwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Aba tu yoya mu kozo no kuneneba ni mwa wene, mu kubiwa kwetu kwa wene, wene Felekisi no kukutekeha, einu no kupula kame itandahala mwa wene muno mu litunga. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Mundila yonje ni kubine konje kame twiitambula mu witumelo no kuneneba. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Kono nji nilese oku sinyeza enako, kame niku kumbela mu sishemo sowe otutetete kweyo tu kwambela. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Kakuli kame tu nawana woyo mulume nji mususwezi omunya tiputeho no Majuda onje mu litunga lyonje, yokame omutwi no tuto no kukeluha no Anazaleta. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Kame ana eteke mane okusilafaza Endoo ya Nyambe, kono natu muleme. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Kono omwendisi no masole Lisiasi, sebeli okeela ni ku mushimba mu maata no kuneneba, okutu byangulaye. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Mu ku mwibanguta mwenyene mba mulimuka okutundelela mwa yonyene einu yonje eyo tu munyaza.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>aendisi no Majuda noyonyene sebeli apumena nji eyo amunyaza ni yaniti. <verse eid="ACT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Cwale omubusisi aba ana kwamba kwa yonyene, Paulusi sebeli otambula nji,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Mu ku limuka nji mu myaka no kupula kame ona tende omwatuli no litunga eli, kame ni wabelelwe okuba oupaki wange. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Kanyi omo olimukele nji kakusibita amaywaa likumi naayiili aba nino katunda ku Jelusalema mu kulaapela. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Kono kasikuniwana meni kanana naanu simba okususweza esicaba, simba mu keleke, simba mu tindoo no milapelo, simba mu mulenen̄i. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Simba mane okulita kwa wene esisupo kweeyo aamba eyange. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Kono kweeyi kame ni pumena kwa wene, nji okukumanena ni Ndila eyo aisaniwa kunyefula, kame ni lapela Nyambe no asitetu ni kupumena einu onje eyo ina lyatisiwa mu mualao simba eyi ina n̄oliwa kwaanuhi a Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Mulibaka nokwikala ni sepo kwa Nyambe neyo nonyene apumena, nji okwinguka kwao no kuluka nawo nakwaluka, <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>mi cwale kame netekanga onene nji ni ikale ni lizwalo kuneku la Nyambe ni aanu. <verse eid="ACT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>Aba kuna kubita emyaka sebli ni lita etituso ni timpo ku Jelusalema kwaanu no kusheba. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Meni lemine okutenda eyi, sebeli aniwana me kenine mu Ndoo ya Nyambe, okuulwile esicaba ni mifilifili. Kono aendisi no Majuda anjili ana kutunda ku Esiya <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>kame afanena okukeela kwaanyi nji kame anyaza nji kame kuli esinjili eso nina foso. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Abakulingeso mu lesele aa alume onyene aambe eso nina kufosa aba nina kwimana balubala no Kuta, <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>konji esinu simweya eso nina kwamba meni imanine mukaci koo, ‘Ni ku kuteka okwinguka nwaafu eyo ni zekisiwa mu liywaa no balelo lino.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Kono Felekisi woyo ona kulimuka wino Endila, sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Aba sa keele Lisiyasi omendisi, okubinda sani nahane etaba yenu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Cwale sebeli oba etaelo ku mwendisi no masole nji iakale mu kutateleliwa nji mu kulukuluha mi aalikani aye abiwe ekolo no kumulitela eyo asela.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Munyima no maywaa, Felekisi sebeli oiya ni moyo waye Dulusila ona kutenda Omujuda, mi sebeli otumena Paulusi ni kuyupa yo aamba mu tumelo mwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Yo lemine okwambola eyi no niti neyi no kuluka ni nuukulema mane ni katulo na kuuso, Felekisi yonyene sebeli ocila ni kwamba nji, “Ba nakon ino ote oweli. Cwale aba sani wane esibaka mba ni kwiisana.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Ba nako imweya sebeli ohupula nji kame sabiwe amali kwa Paulusi. Cwale sebeli omutumena aka no kupula nikamba kwayonyena. <verse eid="ACT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Kono aba ina kubwa eilimo yiili, Felekisi kame ana kuyoliwa kwa Polosiusi Festusi, ni ku laekaza okutenda aendisi no Majuda ouwa, Felekisi sebeli osiya Paulusi mu tolongo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo Kumbela kwa Sizale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Cwale Fesitasi aba ana keela aye, munyima no aywaa aatu, sebeli okambamena ku Jelusalema okutunda mu Sesaliya. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Omupulisita mukulu naakulu no majuda sebeli akumonahaza kwa yonyene, mi sebeli abiha kwayonyene okukumanena neya Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>mi sebeli akumbela nji atende mukwaawabelisa nji aatumene Paulusi ku Jelusalema, okulela okumu kundamena nji amwibae ba ndila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Fesitusi sebeli otambula nji, Paulusi kame ali mu Sesaaliya, ni kwamba nji ni yonyene okutwa atemo abano. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Cwale sebeli waamaba nji, “Mu lusele alume aali ni tukelo mukaci kenu ashetumuke ni mene, mi nji kame kuli eso sina fosahala mwa yonyene, aiye mukumuhapeleza.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Cwale aba ana ku mana okwikala noo mu maywaa no kwaakwana mutanu ni twaatu simba likumi, sebeli oukela ku Sesaaliya. Ba liywaa lina kutatamako sebeli oikala ba situlo no katulo, mi sebeli olaelela nji Pulusi alitiwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Cwale aba ana kwiiya, aendisi no Majuda ana kutunda ku Jelusalema sebeli amubeeka mukaci, ni ku hapeleza emibonda no kupula eyo akwangwa okulita oupaki wayo. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Paulusi yonyene sebeli okutambwela nji, “Kanisifoseza omulawo no Majuda, simba Endoo ya Nyambe, simbsa Sesale kanisi mufoseza simba kanyonyo.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Kono Fesitusi muku singa oku wabeliswa aendisi no Majuda, sebeli wamba kwa Paulusi nji, “Ninji kame osaela okuta ku Jelusalema, mi omo oka atulwemo eyambo eto balubala wange?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli wamba nji, “Kame niimanine balubala no Kuta ya Sesale, moni lukela okwatulwela, Ku Majuda kanisifoza simba simyeya, kanyi omo olimukele wino ni wene. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Nji cwale kame nina matuka omulawo, nikutenda esinjili eso sifanena elifu, sikana okufa, kono nji kakwisa eniti mu yambo eyo aninungelela, kakwisa woyo sonibeeka mu maata oo. Kame niku lilelela kwa Sesale.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Cwale Festusi aba ana ku kwaambota nasikuta yaye, sebeli otambula nji, “Kame ona bilaelele kwa Sesale, kame soote kwa Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi booso wa Agipa ni Benisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Cwale munyima no maywaa acana aba ana kubwa, Aglipa ombumu ni Belunice sebeli akeela mu Sesaaliya mu kutambula Felstusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Cwale aba ana kwikalamo amaywaa no kupula, Festusi sebeli wambela Ombumu eyambo ta Paulusi nji, “Kuno kame kuli omulume ona siiwa mu tolongo kwa Felekisi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Aba nina kwikala ku Jelusalema, apulisita akulu naakulu no Majuda kame ana kwiiya kwa mene mukuni simweta eyambo ya Paulusi, ni kukumbela nji aatulelwe elifu. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Kono sebeli naatambula nji kasa tukelo no sizo no Maloma okulumelela okwatuliwa abo omuzeki ni muzekisi kaasikuwana kale olubala ni lubala mane ni kubiwa okolo noukutambwela mu yambo yaye eyo amuzekisa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Cwalehe abo aneeyi bamweya kuno, kanasiku liyeha, kono eliywaa linakutatamako sebeli niikala ba situlo no katulo ni ku laela nji alitiwe balubala no Kuta. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Cwale azekisi aye aba ana kwiimana, kasaamba esinjili no mibonda yaye eyo ana ku mununga, kanyi eyo nina kutatelela nji niiyupe. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Kono kame ana kwikala ni ngambolo naye eyi no tumelo yoo neyi no munjili woyo wiisaniwa nji Jesu, woyo ona kufa, kono Paulusi kame aongota nji kame ayoya. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Mulibaka no kuziyeleha mu yambo no ngeso, sebeli ni mwibanguta nji kautwese okuta ku Jelusalema nji okaatulelweko etaba eyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Kono cwale Paulusi sebeli okumbela nji abekiwe mu sitokisi okutatela ekatulo no Mbumu omukulu, sebeli ni laela nji ababalelwe okubitela aba sanimu tumene kwa Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Cwale Aglipa sebeli wamba kwa Festusi nji, “Kame ni singa okuyupa wkwa woyo mulume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festusi sebeli otambula nji, “Mbumumono byuunda,”<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Booso wa Aglipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Cwale eliywaa aba lina kupa Aglipa ni Belunice sebeli aiya mu umbumu no kuneneba ni kwiingena mu Kuta aali naendisi no masole, naanu akulu no mulenen̄i. Cwale mu taelo ya Fesitusi, Paulusi sebeli olitiwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Cwale Fesitasi sebeli wamba nji, “Mbumu Aglipa nawo onje aikalile naaci muno, mumumwine omulume woyo aneyele aendisi no Majuda no kupula kwa mene mu ku muzekisa, bamweya mu Jelusalema ni muno, sebeli akuweleza nji kalukeele okuyoya kame. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Kono kame nina wana nji kakwisa omubonda anatende owo ofanena elifu, yonyene kame ana kubilaeze okuta kwa Sesale, kame ni nawana oku mutumenako. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Kono sikwite eso ni lukela okun̄olela kwa Sisale eso no niti mu taba yaye. Cwalehe kame nina muliti balubala lwenu, onene balubala lowe wene luli Ombumu Aglipa, nji munyima no kwamba etaba yaye, ni limuke eso sani twese okun̄ola. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Kakuli kwa mene ni taba nokwa yupahala aba sa ku tumiwe omunu no kunungiwa, ka kumonisiwa eyambo ana zekisiwa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yoku Tambwela balubala lwa Aglipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Aglipa sebeli wamba kwa Paulusi nji, “Kame opumenenwe nji waambe.” Cwale Paulusi sebeli olola elikaa lyaye ni kwamba nji,<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>“Kame ni kwite etitonolo okwikala balubala lowe wene ombumu Aglipa, mi kame sa nibe oupaki wange wonje ku yambo eto anitamilikeza a majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Kakuli wene olimukile emilao ni yambo eyo kasingi a majuda, cwale kame ni kukumbela nji oni tetete wino.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>“Omooyo wange okutunda ku wanuke, inaikala okutunda kumatatekelo mu sicaba no abaange mane ni ku Jelusalema, kame a ulimukile oonje a majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Kakuli kame au limukile, nji kame saela okupaka eniti, nji okukumanena ni ulapeli kame inakuyoya kanyi mufalisi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Mi bano kame ni imana kuti ni atulwe mu sepo eyo a na ku sepisa Nyambe kwa sitetu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>eyo emishobo yetu likumu ni yiili asepile okawana, abo sa lapele mu niti omunji ni usiku, mi musepiso eyi ya ni nyaza nayo aendisi no Majuda. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Aanyi nji nisinu sikwangwiwa oku pumena nji Nyambe kame atwesa okwingula asikufa?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>“Mene menyene, niti luli kame nina yambuta nji kame nina kufanena okutenda einu no kupula mu kulwisa elitina lya Jesu no Nazaleta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Kame nini ku tenda ngeso mu Jelusalema, oku yatilela aasikupumena mu tolongo, oku tunda mu maata nina kubiwa kwa apulisita akulu, kono cwale aba ana kwaatulela elifu, ni mene sebeli ni pumena okwaalwisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Aka no kupula mu tindoo no milapelo tonje kame nina kwakandimekanga nji anyefule, mi kakuli kame nina kwaatwebela ouyi, sebeli nikaayandisa mu milenen̄i indina.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauluso yooba oupaki waye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Tikezo9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>“Mane sebeli nita ku Damaseka mu maata ni mu taelo no apulisita akulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Omunji luli Molyange, sebeli ni mona olumonyi menili mu ndila luna kutunda ku wilu, no ku benya onene okubitelela eliseli no liywaa, sebeli linibeeka mukaci na nina kweenda noo. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Cwale aba tuna kukwela banji tonje, sebeli ni yupa eliywi elyaamba kwa mene mu mushobo no Sihebelu nji, ‘Saule,Saule, iikene oniyandiseta? Kame olemana aba olaha ku muwayo.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Cwale sebeli ni ibanguta nji, ‘Tiwe anyine, Mbumu?’ Ombumu sebeli otambula nji, ‘Time Jesu woyo olemine okuyandisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Kono oinguke mi wimane ni makondo owe, kakuli kame nina kumonaha kwa wene mulibaka eli, oku kuketa nji osebeze nikuba oupaki mweyo ona mono ni kweyo saniku monahaze nayo mwa wene otenda opaki no inu ino. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Kame sani ku lamulele kwaanu aa ni kwasimacaba oko ni ku tumena kwa onyene. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Nji otonise amiyo oo, nji afutuke okutunda mu uwi okuta mu liseli ni mu maata no Satani ni kusiulukela kwa Nyambe, ni ku lemeniwa ku iibi yoo, mi ni sibaka saawo akenine ni ku pumena mwa mene.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo ambaa eyi no musebezi waye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>“Okutunda abo, Molyange Mbumu Aglipa, kani sikana oku yupa ku pono na kuwilu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Kono sebeli olemusa oweli ali ku Daseka, cwale ni mu Jelusalema ni mu naha yonje no Judeya, mane ngeeso ni kwaa simacaba, nji kam e afanena oku baka ni ku futukela kwa Nyambe ni ku tenda emisebezi eyo ilukela awo ana baka. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Mulibaka elyo aendisi no Majuda lyokame anani nungele eyambo mu Ndoo ya Nyambe elyo asinga okuni ibaela. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Mu liywaa no balelelo kame nina wana etuso okutunda kwa Nyambe, mi cwale kame niimana bano okuba oupaki kwaakkulu bamweya naanyonyo, kakwisa eso naamba kono eyo anaamba anuhi a Nyambe ni Mushe mbaitendahala, <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>nji Jesu mbayanda, mi cwale yokame no weeli okwinguka kwaanu, mi kame saambe eliseli kwaanu ni kwaasimacaba.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Cwale Paulusi yooba oupaki waye, Fesitusi sebeli wamba ni liywi linene nji, Paulusi, kame olyangana, oukwiiyeta kowe no kuneneba kame ku kupulumukisa!” <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli wamba nji, “Mene, sitakana, molyange Fesitasi, kono kame naamba eniti luli. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Kakuli Ombumu oilimukile eyi inu, mi kwayonyene kame naamba meni lukuluhile, kakuli kame ni pumena nji einu eyi kakwisa eso kalimukile. kakuli eyo kaisiku tendahalela ku mukunda. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Mbumu Aglipa, kana kame opumena kwaanuhi a Nyambe? Kame nilimukile nji kame opumena!” <verse eid="ACT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Cwale Aglipa sebeli wamba kwa Paulusi nji, “Mu nako ino inyonyo kame osinga nji ni futuke omuasikupumena?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Paulusi sebeli otambula nji, “Simba enako inyonyo simba no kupula, kame ni twesa kwa Nyambe nji kasa wene feela kono nawo onje aniyupa mu liywaa lino kame safeke kanyi mene, konji fela amawenge.” <verse eid="ACT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Cwale Ombumu sebeli oimana, ni mubusisi ni Benisi, naao ana kwikala noo, <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>mi cwale aba ana kumana okunda ba Kuta, sebeli akwambisa mukaci koo nji, “Uyu mulume kakwisa eso ana tende nji aatulelwe elifu simba okunungiwa mu tolongo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Cwale Aglipa sebeli wamba kwa Festusi nji, “Uyu mulume kame afanena oku lukululwa kambe kasi ku litiwa balubala wa Sesale.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Paulusi Yota ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Cwale abo abaabna kulumelelana nji ate mu Italiya, sebeli atwala Paulusi ni mapantiti anjili ku mukulu no masole Juliusi no sikwata no Augusto. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Aba ana kumana okwingena mu sisepe no Adlamiti, eso sina kufunduka ku likamba lya Asia sebeli tu fuula aaci ni Alisitako na mu ku Tesalonika omundi na mu Mesadoniya. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Eliywaa lina ku tatamako sebeli tu kakeela mu Sidoni, mi Juliyasi sebeli obabalela wino Paulusi, ni ku mufundula nji ate kwaabaye aka mu babalele. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Cwale sebeli amubeeka mu sisepe sina kuta ku Sipulasi, kakuli Emebo kame ina ku tulwisa. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Cwale aba tunakumana okuluta eliwate eli lita ku Silisia ni Pamifilia, sebei tu keela mu Mila mu Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Omwendisi no masole sebeli owanamo esisepe sa Alekizanda eso sina kuta ku Italia sebeli otubeekamo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Kame tuna kweenda mu kwaleluba mu maywaa no kupula, mi sebeli tu kakeela ku Silisia mu ku bambaba, mikanyi Emebo aba ina kutukanena oku luta sebeli tu kulisa ku nyonga ya Kilete ku lineku lya Salumoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Me tu kulisa elikamba mu kubambaba, sebeli twiiya mu sibaka siisaniwa Feya Habenisi, abeebi ni mulenen̄i no Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Mu kusinya enako no kupula, mi omusipili sebeli ocilisa kakuli okweti kame ina kubwa, cwale Paulusi sebeli waaeleza nji, <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>“Aolyange, kame ni mwene nji omusipili kame so ikale ni tikolofalo ni kusinyehelwa onene, kasa eibyana fela ni sisepe, kono bamweya ni moyo wetu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Kono omwendisi no masole sebeli obeeka etingana ku mwendisi ni munya sisepe okubita eyo ana kwamba Paulusi. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Cwale mulibaka no likamba okwa lukela oku fuwekelamo ba nako no mubebo, aanu no kupula sebeli aaeleza nji afuwekela fela mu liwate, mu litohonolo nji mba twese okakeela ku Fenekasi mu likamba no Kilete, elyo lyalikete ku mutulo ni upa, ni mbowela ni upa, okapumulelamo omubebo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elin̄ungwa ba Liwate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Cwale Emebo naku mbowela aba ifuka wino, sebeli ahupula nji, omulelo woo mbaukondo, niku mona Ankola, sebeli afuula okukulisa amakamba no Kilete ao ali beebi ni likamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Kono kuuso mbicana sebeli kwinguka Emebo no lin̄ungwa elyo lisaniwa Eulakilo. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Cwale esisepe ba si nakushimbiwa ku mebo, sebeli sikwangwa oku yaliketa, sebeli tusi lesela sita nayo. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Cwale sebeli tu kashetwa kunji no sooli no Kilauda, ni kusinga okukwangwa oku kokela esisepe sicana. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Aba ana kumana okanona, sebeli ongota esisepe mu kusinunga emihala eyo ikeela kunji, mi mulibaka nji kame ana kucila okukashetwa ba muuwa naku Silete, sebeli akwisa amaseili ni kukuka yongeso. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Kakuli kame tuna ku lwisiwa ku mebo no lin̄ungwa, mu liywaa lina kutatamako sebeli atateka okukondela etutu yoo mu liwate eyo ina longiwa mu sisepe, <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>mi ba liywaa no waatu sebeli tu kondela ni maoko etu, einu eyo yendisa esisepe nayo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Cwale eliywaa simba etitungweti kaisiku moniwa mu mywaa no kupula, mi eliwate kame lina bifi ouyi ku mebo, mane sebeli tuulwa esepo nji mbatu yoisiwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Cwale aba ana kwikala amaywaa no kupula aulwile esi no kulya, Paulusi cwale sebeli oiya kwa onyene ni kwaamba nji, “Alume, kambe kame muna kuni pumena oweli me musi fuula kale ku Kilete, kambe kamusiilwa okulemana ni ku sinyehelwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Kono cwale kame ni mi kutaza, mu koongote, kakuli kakwisa woyo so sinyehelwa omoyo kono kame sa ku sinyeha fela esisepe. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Kakuli ouno usiku elin̄eloi lya Nyambe nali kumonahaza kwa mene nili waye woyo ni sebeleza <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>mi sebeli lyaamba nji, ‘Paulusi olese okucila, kame so kaimane balubala lwa Sesale, mi omone, Nyambe nakubi onje awo oluta noo mu sisepe.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Cwale mongole emicima, alume! Kakuli kame nili ni tumelo mwa Nyambe nji kame sa ku tendahale kanyi omo nina ambelwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Kono kame sa tu twaliwe ku yooli injili.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okulwela No Sisepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Cwale eliywaa no likumi ni tunee aba lina kukeela, me tu twaliwa oku nooku ku mebo mu liwate no Andilia, mu kaci no usiku aapuwi no sisepe sebeli akakanya nji natu keela ku naha injili. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Cwale aba aana kweteka ouliba no meyi sebeli awana eibima makumi aatu ni twiili, kuuso mbicana sebeli aeteka kame sebeli awana eibima makumi ayiili ni mutanu ni twiili. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Kame ana kucila nji mwendi mba tu twaliwa ku mebo ba mawee, sebeli akwisa amanjanga anee na mu litusi na kunyima nji esisepe siimane, mi kame ana ku lakaza nji kupee. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Cwale aapuwi no sisepe sebeli asaela oku luta okutunda mu sisepe, okwingena mu sisepe sicana mu liwate kanyi kame akakwisa atiankola na ku litusi na ku uso. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Paulusi sebeli osimweta omwendisi no masole ni masole nji, “Konji aa alume aba saikale mu sisepe, okubinda samu yoye.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Cwale amasole sebeli apatula omuhala no sisepe, ni kuulesela okutela.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Cwale eliywaa ekalya sipa kale, Paulusi sebeli waakumbela onje nji alye eilya, ni kwamba nji, “Balelo yakwana kale amywaa likumi ni anee me mutatelele nuuku yumena eilya, memu ulwile esi no kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Cwalehe kame ni mikumbela nji mulye esilya, mbaimibi okongola, kakuli kakwisa oluuki na ba mutwi no munu ni munu kwaanyi olo salu sinyehe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okwamba eyi, sebeli oshimba esinkwa, nuukutumela kwa Nyambe balubala woo onje ni ku sipatola ni ku tangisa okulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Cwale sebeli aongola emicima ni kulya eilya nonyene. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Kame tunaku kwana epalo ikuma ba myaanda yiili ni makumi mutanu naayili ni mutanu ni kamweya (276) aanu mu sisepe. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okulya wino, sebeli afukuza kukulema no sisepe oku yumbela ouloto mu liwate.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Cwale aba lina kupa eliywaa, kasi kulimuka enaha eyo nji ibine, mi sebeli alemuha esiko sili ni likamba, cwale sebeli asinga nji aba kukonahala atwalemo esisepe. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Cwale sebeli apatula emihala ina nungu etinkola ni kwisiya mu liwate, mi mu nako imweya ni kusheputula emihala eyo inungile amabala no ku siululisa esisepe, mi ni ku imeka eseili no kuneneba ba libala no sisepe nji cwale Emebo aba ifulabo yaatwale ku likamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Kono sebeli tu fuwama bamwalala no mushekesheke eso sili ni meyi oku nooku. Elitusi nakunyima sebeli licoka, cwale eli nakuuso sebeli likakatela ba mushekesheke<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Omuhupulo no masole neli nji aibae amapantiti, okwaa sileleza nji alese okuyowa ni ku sila. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Kono omwendisi no masole mu ku singa okuyoisa Paullusi, sebeli waakanisa, mi ni ku laele nji aa atwesa okuyowa, amatukele oweeli mu liwate ate ba likamba, <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>mi anjili aku tusise amabala, anjili baibindi ina coko no sisepe. Cwale mokame omo ana ku keelela ba likamba, aayoya.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Mu Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Munyima no kuyoya ngeso, okubinda cwale tu limuke nji esooli eso kame siisaniwa nji Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Ni man̄eke aa alimo sebeli atutenda mu sishemo no kuneneba, ni kutu tambula toonje omunu ni munu, mi sebeli atumbula omulilo no kuneneba, mulibaka no mbula ona kuloka ni mulibaka no seenge. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli ocaa en̄ata no wandilala no itondo no kuku kuta ni kwibeeka ba mulilo, omo sebeli kutunda esibili mulibaka no kweenya, sebeli siku tingeta ba Lyoko lyaye. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Cwale aman̄ete aba ana ku mona enyoka ilepelela ba Lyoko lyaye, sebeli akwambisa mukaci koo nji, “Luli omunu uyu ni mwiibai, kakuli naaba aba bandukamu liwate, ouku faniketa ku wilu kalukele okuyoya. <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Kono Paulusi sebeli otutulele fela enyoka mu mulilo kaisimu tenda ouyi. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Aanu kame ana kutatelela okumona nji kame sa timbe simba okukwela banji ababo nji afe, kono kame ana kutatelela ba nako no kuleba onene, mi sebeli amona nji kakwisa esi sitendahala kwa yonyene, sebeli afutuka okwamba nji neli nyambe.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Abeebi ni sibaka eso tuna kwikala kame kuna kwikala onduna no sooli wisaniwa nji Pubuliyasi, ni yonyene sebeli otu tambula wino, niku tushimba ku ndoo yaye amaywaa aatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Sitaye Publiusi kame ana ku langana okukola efibele ni ku sulula ounyinga. Pauusi sebeli otako oka mulekula ni kulapela, sebeli omu beeka amaoko aye beeulu niku mubalisa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Eyo aba ina kubwa, onje aanu asikutoma ba sooli sebei aiya, mi kame ana ku balisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Cwale sebeli atuba etimpo no kupula, mi aba tuna ku fuula, sebeli atubeekela mu sisepe eyo tuna ku saela.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oku tunda mu Malite okuta ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Munyima no tikweti taatu sebeli tu funduka ni sisepe sina ku fuwekelanga musoli, esisepe na ku Alekizandiliya, mi balitusi ababekilwe esiswaniso no aana no mambile <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Aba tu na kukeela mu Silakuze sebeli twi ikalamo amaywaa aatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Mi aba tu na kufundaka sebeli twenda ku nyonga no liwate mi sebeli tu kakela ku Lihegiomu, mi munyima no liywaa limweya Emebo naku mboela sebeli ifuka, mi ba liywaa li no wiili sebeli tu kafuweka mu Petiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Omo sebeli tu ka wana aasikupumena, mi sbeli atumema njintwiikale noo mu maywaa ana kukwana mutanu naayiili. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Cwale aasikupumena omo aba ana ku tuyupa sebeli aiya okutunda oku no kuleba ku Folamu mu sibaka no Appiusi ni ku mahotela aatu mukutu waniketa. Mu kwaamona, Paulusi sebeli oku tumela kwa Nyambe nikuongola omucima.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo kutaza mu Loma munji no atateleli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Cwale aba tuna kukeela mu Loma, Paulusi sebeli amu lumelela nji aikale yomboci ni masole awo ana ku mu sileleza.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Munyima no maywaa aatu, sebeli oisana aendisi no Majuda, mi cwale aba anokuwana sebeli wamba kwa onyene nji, “Abaange, naaba kanisi tenda esinjili okulwisa aanu simba esizo sa Sitetu, kono kame nina kubeekiwa mu tolongo mu Jelusalema mu maata no Maloma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Cwale aba ana kumana okuni ibanguta, sebeli asinga nji ani lukulule, kakuli kame ku nakuulwa omubonda no lifu mu taba yange. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Kono aendisi no Majuda aba ana kukana, cwale sebeli ni ku bilaeza kwa Sesale, simba nji kani sikwikala ni mubonda no ku lwisa enaha yange. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Cwalehe mulibaka elyo kame nina kumbele nji ni kumone, kakuli ni mulibaka no sepo no Isilaele eyo inisaiseta oku nungiwa amawenge.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Cwale sebeli aamba kwa onyene nji, “Katu sitambula aman̄olo okutunda ku Judeya aa aamba eyowe, mi kakwisa aasikupumena ana tundu oko aneeyi mu kubiha simba okwamba eyi no kwiiba ona ku tenda. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Kono kame tu singa okuyupa kwa wene eso onahana, kakuli okwamana ku tuto no Ndila kame tu limuka nji kame ilwisa koonje.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Cwale aba ana kumana oku lukisa eliywaa nookuwana naye, sebeli aiya oko ana kwikalanga mu kupula. Cwale sebeli waatolokela eyaye yonje oku tunda amasiku konji ku mangolwaa, okupaka eyi no mubuso wa Nyambe, nikweteka nji alumele eyambo ya Jesu bamweya oku tunda ba mulawo wa Mushe naanuhi a Nyambe. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Cwale anjili sebeli apumena eyo ana kwamba, mi anjili sebeli akana. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Cwale mu kukana okuyupa mukaci koo, sebeli afunduka, munyima ya Paulusi okwamba eliywi limweya nji, “Emebo No Kukena kame ina kwamba eniti kwa sitenu okubitela mu munuhi wa Nyambe Isaya nji,<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>‘Mute kwaanu aa, mi mu kaambe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">luli mba mu yupu kono kamutamba ku yupisisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">mi luli mba mu mono kono kamutamba oku monisisa,<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>kakuli emicima no aanu aa, kame yongolile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ni matwi oo kaayupu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">mi amiyo oo kame akutimine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">kono amiyo oo kame ana fanene okumona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">amatwi oo kame afanena okuyupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">mane ni kuyupisisa ni micima yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">mi kame afutukela kwa mene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nji naabalise.’” <verse eid="ACT 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Cwale mulimuke nji, “Okuyoisa kwa Nyamba kame kuna ku tumenwa asimacaba mi kame sayupe!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Aba ana kumana okwamba amaywi ao, aendisi no Majuda sebeli amusiya, mi sebeli kwikala etin̄ananyi no kuneneba mukaci koo.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Cwale Paulusi sebeli oikala eilimo yiili mu ndoo eyo ana kutenekanga amali, ni ku tambulanga aanu onje awo ana kwiyanga kwa yonyene. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Kame ana ku kutazanga eyi no mubuso wa Nyambe ni kwaiyeta eyi ya Mbumu Jesu Kilesite epatalaza no kwaulwa okushweka simba simweya.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
